<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id" />
  <para style="h">JON</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kwena Maber ma Jon Ocoyo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jon</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jon</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kwena Maber ma</para>
  <para style="mt1">JON</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ocoyo</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Kwena Maber ma Jon ocoyo nyutu Yecu ni obedo Lok pa Lubanga matye labed naka ma oloke odoko dano ci “obedo ma kwo ikinwa,” 1:14. Kit macalo buk man tito, buk me Kwena Maber man kicoyo wek lukwanone guye ni Yecu aye obedo Lalar mayam con kiciko pireni, en aye Wod pa Lubanga, dok bene ka guketo niyegi ikome ci gibinongo kwo 20:31.</para>
  <para style="ip">Inge lanyut man ma tito kamaleng ni Yecu en aye obedo Lok pa Lubanga ma rii matwal, dul mukwongo me Kwena Maber man kelo kamaleng ginanyuta me aura ma nyutu ni Yecu aye obedo lalar mayam kiciko pireni, dok bene en aye Wod pa Lubanga. Dul malubu man tito telok ma mako ginanyuta magi ducu ma otime. Dul man tito kit ma dano mogo guketo niyegi ikom Yecu kun gidoko kwede lulub kore, wa ki jo mogo ma gujemo ikome kun gikwero keto niyegi ikome. Cura (13—17) tito matut kit ma Yecu obedo ka nywako kacel ki lupwonyene iwor ma kimake iyeni, ki kit ma obedo kalok kwedgi kun jingo cwinygi wek gubed atera ma pud peya kigure ikom yat. Cura ma dolo lok ma i buk man tito kit ma kimako ki Yecu, ngolo kop iwiye, gure ikom yat wa ki nicer ki i lyel, ki kit ma obedo ka nyute bot lupwonyene madong otyeko cer woko ki i lyel.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lok atita ikom dako ma kimako katimo tim aborni i cura 8:1-11 kitwodo kakare woko pien lucoc macon wa ki lugony leb macon guweko lok atita man woko, ento jo mukene gire gucoyo lok man kamaleng.</para>
  <para style="ip">Jon keto kili ikom lok ma mako mic me kwo ma labednaka ma a ki i Yecu, mic man matye kombedi kun bino bot jo ma giye ni Yecu aye yo, ki ada, ki kwo. Jon nyutu lapor mapol ma a ki i kwo me nino ducu me nyutu ada me kwo me cwiny, lapore jami macalo pii, mugati, dero, lakwat ki romine, poto olok ki nyig olok.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Lok atita <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 1:1-18">1:1-18</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jon Labatija ki lupwonye pa Yecu mukwongo <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 1:19-51">1:19-51</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Tic pa Yecu ikin lwak <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 2:1-12:50">2:1—12:50</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kare me agiki me kwo pa Yecu i Jerucalem ki i kabedo ma cokcok ki kunu <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 13:1-19:42">13:1—19:42</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Nicer ki nyute pa Rwot <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 20:1-31">20:1-31</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ladol lok: nyutene bene i Galilaya <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 21:1-25">21:1-25</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s1">Lok me kwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />I acaki Lok onongo dong tye, Lok onongo tye bot Lubanga, Lok onongo en Lubanga. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />En yam tye bot Lubanga i acaki. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Jami ducu yam kitiyo kun a ki i en, pe tye gin mo mayam kicweyo labongo en. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />I en onongo tye pete me kwo, kwo meno con obedo dero lameny piny pa dano. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Dero ryeny menyo piny macol, ento piny macol pe twero genge ryeny.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:1">Mat 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mar 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1">Luk 3:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:2">2</ref></char>
    </note> Yam tye dano mo ma Lubanga ooro, nyinge Jon. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />En obino pi bedo caden me tito lok ikom dero meno, wek dano ducu guye pi loke. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />En kikome onongo pe dero, ento obino pi tito lok me caden ikom dero.<verse eid="JHN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Dero me ada ma menyo dano ducu onongo obibino i lobo. <verse eid="JHN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />En yam con onongo tye i lobo, jami ducu yam kicweyo kun a ki i en, ento lobo pe obedo ki ngec ikome. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />En obino tugi, ento lutugi pe gujole. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Ento dano ducu ma gujole, ma guye en, en omiyogi twero me doko lutino pa Lubanga. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Gin pe gudoko lutino pa Lubanga pi remogi, kadi pi miti me kom, kadi pi miti pa dano, ento pi miti pa Lubanga.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Lok odoko dano, obedo ikinwa, kun opong ki kica ki ada; wan waneno deyone, deyo ma en onongo macalo pa latin acel keken ma en wod pa Won. <verse eid="JHN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Jon obolo lok me caden ikome kun dange ni, “Man aye ngat mayam atitiwu pire ni, ‘Ngat ma bino ingeya kata ki dit, pien en okwongo bedo tye inyima wa yam con.’” <verse eid="JHN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Nia i lonyone mapol wan ducu kimediwa kica ikom kica. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Pien cik yam kimiyo kun wok ki bot Moses, ento kica ki ada, Yecu Kricito aye okelo. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Pe tye ngat mo mayam oneno Lubanga; kono Wod acel keken marom ki Lubanga, matye acel ki Won, en aye omiyo Won ongene.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok me caden ma Jon otito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mar 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-9">Luk 3:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Man lok me caden ma Jon obolo, ikare ma Lujudaya guoro ajwaki pa Lubanga ki jo Levi nia Jerucalem bote me penye ni, “In anga?” <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />En otucu kamaleng, pe omungo, otucu ni, “An pe a Kricito ma Lubanga oyero.” <verse eid="JHN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mal 4:5</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Nwo 18:15</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref></char></note> Gupenye ni, “In dong anga? In Eliya bo?” En odok iye ni, “Pe.” Ci gin dok gupenye ni, “In lanebi mono?” En ogamo ni, “Pe”. <verse eid="JHN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Dok gupenye ni, “In anga ka? Titiwa, wek wadwok lok bot jo ma oorowa. Ilwonge kekeni ni in anga?” <verse eid="JHN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Ica 40:3</ref></char></note> En odok iye ni, “An a dwon ngat ma dange i tim ni, ‘Wutir yo pa Rwot ocung atir,’ kit mayam lanebi Icaya owaco.”<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Jo mogo ma ceng kiorogi nia ikin Luparicayo <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />gupenye ni, “Dong pingo ibatija dano, ka in pe i Kricito ma Lubanga oyero, nyo Eliya, nyo lanebi meno?” <verse eid="JHN 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Jon odok ki gin iye ni, “An abatija dano ki pii; ento ikinwu ocung ngat mo ma wun wukwiya, <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />en aye ngat ma bino ki ingeya, ma an pe amyero me gonyo del ware.” <verse eid="JHN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Lok man ducu otime i Betania loka Jordan, kama Jon yam obedo ka batija iye dano.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Latin romo pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Orwone Jon oneno Yecu kun woto bino tung bote, ci owaco ni, “Nen Latin romo pa Lubanga ma kwanyo bal me lobo! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Man aye ngat mayam awaco pire ni, ‘Ingeya bibino ngat ma kata ki dit, pien en okwongo bedo inyima wa yam con.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />An kikoma onongo pe angeye, ento pi lok man omiya abino kun abatija dano ki pii, wek kinyute bot Jo Icrael.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Jon otito lok me caden ikome ni, “Ceng aneno Cwiny Maleng kun bino nia ki i polo macalo amam, opye, obedo ikome. <figure style="fig" alt="The Spirit descending as a dove from heaven" file="4400132.TIF" size="col" copy="Anie Vallton" ref="1:32">Cwiny Maleng obino nia ki i polo macalo amam</figure> <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />An kikoma yam pe angeye; ento ngat ma oora ka batija dano ki piini owaca ni, ‘Ngat ma ibineno Cwiny Maleng bino, pye, bedo ikome, en aye ngat ma bibatija dano ki Cwiny Maleng.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Dong aneno, dok atito lok me caden ikome ni, man en Wod pa Lubanga.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lupwonye ma gukwongo lubu Yecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Orwone doki, ma Jon ocung ki jo aryo ikin lupwonyene, <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />ci oneno Yecu matye kawot, ci owaco ni, “Nen Latin romo pa Lubanga!” <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Lupwonye meno aryo guwinyo kun waco lok man, ci gulubu Yecu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yecu oloke, onenogi kun gilube, ci openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Wuyenyo ango?”</char> Ci jonu gupenye ni, “Rabbi (ma te loke ni, Lapwony) ibedo kwene?” <verse eid="JHN 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Ci Yecu odok ki gin ni, <char style="wj">“Wubin, wunen.”</char> Ci gubino, guneno kama en onongo bedo iye; ci gubedo bote inino meno, pien cawa dong onongo cok romo apar.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Ngat acel ikin jo aryo mayam guwinyo Jon kun loko, ci gulubu Yecu, onongo Anderiya, omin Cimon Petero. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />En okwongo nongo omine Cimon, ci owace ni, “Watyeko nongo Meciya” (ma te loke ni, Kricito). <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Ci otere bot Yecu. Ka Yecu onene, ci owace ni, <char style="wj">“In aye Cimon, wod pa Jon. Kibilwongi ni, Kepa”</char> (ma en aye Petero dok teloke “pata”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1:42 </char> <char style="fk">Petero </char> teloke Pata.</note>).<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu olwongo Pilipo ki Natanael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Orwone Yecu oa me cito i Galilaya. Ka orwate ki Pilipo, ci owace ni, <char style="wj">“Luba.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Pilipo yam onongo a ki i taun Betecaida, ma obedo taun ma Anderiya ki Petero bene gia ki iye. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Pilipo onongo Natanael, ci otite ni, “Watyeko nongo ngat ma Moses yam ocoyo pire i Cik, ma lunebi bene gucoyo pire, en aye Yecu me Najaret, wod pa Yucepu.” <verse eid="JHN 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Ci Natanael openye ni, “Gin mo maber twero kati ki i Najaret?” Pilipo odoke iye ni, “Bin, inen.”<verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Ka Yecu oneno Natanael matye kabino bote, ci oloko ikome ni, <char style="wj">“Nen Laicrael me ada, ma pe tye ki goba mo i cwinye!”</char> <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Piman Natanael openye ni, “Ingeya ningning?” Yecu odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“An aneni ma onongo ibedo ite olam ma peya Pilipo olwongi.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Natanael odoke iye ni, “Lapwony, in giri i Wod pa Lubanga. In i Rwot me Icrael!” <verse eid="JHN 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Ci Yecu odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“In iye pien awaci ni, ‘Aneni ka ibedo ite olam’? Ibineno jami madito makato magi.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:51: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:12">Aca 28:12</ref></char></note> Dok owace ni, <char style="wj">“Adada awaciwu ni, wubineno ka polo yabe, kun lumalaika pa Lubanga giito dok gilor piny ikom Wod pa dano.”</char><verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s1">Nyom i Kana me Galilaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Inino me adeke nyom mo obedo i Kana, i taun me Galilaya. Min Yecu onongo tye kunu, <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Yecu ki lupwonyene bene kilwongogi i nyom meno. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Ka kongo bwino otum, min Yecu owaco ki Yecu ni, “Kongo bwinogi dong otum woko.” <verse eid="JHN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Ci Yecu odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“Mego, in aye ma pe iwaca gin ma omyero atii. Cawana pud peya oromo.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Ci mine ociko lutic ni, “Wutim gin ducu ma en biwaciwu.” <verse eid="JHN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />I gang nyom kunu onongo tye dak pii me got abicel ma kicibo pi kit yo me lwok me lonye pa Lujudaya. Dak acel acel onongo gwoko pii maromo lita miya acel. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yecu owacigi ni, <char style="wj">“Wuony pii i dak.”</char> Ci guonyo opong woko libyeny. <figure style="fig" alt="The servant filling the jars with water" file="LB00135B.TIF" size="col" copy="Horace Knowles" ref="2:7">Latic tye kaonyo pii i dak</figure> <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Ci Yecu dok wacigi ni, <char style="wj">“Dong wutwom, wuter bot ladit me nyom.”</char> Ci gutero pii meno. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Ka ladit me nyom obilo pii madong oloke odoko bwino, ci pe ongeyo kama oa iye (ento lutic ma gutwomo pii keken aye onongo gingeyo). Piman ladit me nyom olwongo lanyom, <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />ci owace ni, “Dano ducu kong kwongo miyo ki lwak bwino mamit; ka dong dano gumato oromogi, ka lacen kikelo ma pe mit tutwale. Ento in ikano mere bwino mamit nio wa kombedi.” <verse eid="JHN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Yecu otiyo Lanyut meno mukwongo i Kana matye i Galilaya, kun nyutu kwede deyone; ci lupwonyene guye en.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 4:13">Mat 4:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Lacen inge nino manok, Yecu ocito i Kapernaum kacel ki mine ki omegine ki lupwonyene; gurii kunu pi nino manok.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocito i Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Nia 12:1-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Karama me Kato pa Lujudaya onongo dong tye cok, omiyo Yecu ocito i Jerucalem. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />I Ot pa Lubanga onongo tye iye jo ma cato dyangi ki romi ki amam, ki lulok cente ma gubedo piny. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Yecu okedo anino ogwil matino, ci oryemogi ducu woko ki i Ot pa Lubanga, kacel ki romi ki twoni. Oketo lim pa lulok cente, kun coro mejagi ryebe piny. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Ci ociko lucat amam ni, <char style="wj">“Teru jami magi woko, pe wulok Ot pa Wora odok cuk.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Jab 69:9</ref></char></note> Ci lupwonyene gupo lok mayam kicoyo ni, “Arima pi odi lyel icwinya calo mac.” <verse eid="JHN 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Piman Lujudaya gupenye ni, “Lanyut ango ma ibinyutu ki wan wek wange kit twero ango ma itye kwede me tiyo jami magi?” <verse eid="JHN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:61">Mat 26:61</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:40">27:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:58">Mar 14:58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:29">15:29</ref></char></note> Yecu ogamo doggi ni, <char style="wj">“Wumuk Ot pa Lubanga man woko, ci abigerone odoco inino adek.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Ci lujudaya guwace ni, “Ot pa Lubanga man kigero pi mwaka pyere angwen wiye abicel kulu. In ibigerone inino adek keken?” <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Ento en onongo loko pi kome ma Ot pa Lubangani. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Ci madong kicere ki ikin jo ma oto, lupwonyene gupo ni yam owaco lok man; ci guye ginacoya ki lok mayam Yecu oloko.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ngeyo kit kwo pa dano ducu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Ka onongo Yecu tye i Jerucalem inino madit me Karama me Kato, jo mapol guketo niyegi ikom nyinge pien guneno lanyut ma en obedo katiyogi. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Ento Yecu kikome pe obedo ki gen ikomgi, <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />pien en ngeyo jo ducu, pe omito ni ngat mo otit lok ikom dano mo bote, pien en kikome ngeyo gin matye i cwiny dano.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu gin ki Nikodemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Yam tye dano mo ikin Luparicayo ma nyinge Nikodemo, ma en ngat acel ikin jo madito me Judaya. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />En obino bot Yecu i dyewor, kun wace ni, “Lapwony, wan wangeyo ni in lapwony ma ia ki bot Lubanga; pien pe tye ngat mo matwero tiyo lanyut meno ma in itiyoni, ka Lubanga pe tye kwede.” <verse eid="JHN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yecu odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“Adada awaci ni, dano ka pe kinywale tyen me aryo pe twero neno ker pa Lubanga.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Ci Nikodemo openye ni, “Dano ka dong odoko dit woko kitwero nywale dok ningning? Twero donyo doki i ot nyodo pa mine tyen me aryo, ci kinywale?” <verse eid="JHN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Ci Yecu odok iye ni, <char style="wj">“Adada awaci ni, dano ka pe kinywale ki pii ki Cwiny ci pe twero donyo i ker pa Lubanga.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" /><char style="wj">Dano kinywale ikom kun a ki bot wone ki mine, ento dano mamito doko latin pa Lubanga myero kinywale ki Cwiny pa Lubanga.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" /><char style="wj">Pe ibed ki ur pien awaci ni, ‘Myero wun ducu kinywalwu tyen me aryo.’</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" /><char style="wj">Yamo kodo dok kama en mito; iwinyo dwone, ento pe ingeyo kama oa iye, nyo kama dok iye. I yo acelu, dano ducu ma kinywalo tyen me aryo ki Cwiny pa Lubanga tye kitmeno.”</char><verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Ci Nikodemo openye ni, “Man twero time ningning?” <verse eid="JHN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yecu odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“In lapwony madit pa Icrael, pe ingeyo lok man?</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" /><char style="wj">Adada awaci ni, wan waloko ikom gin ma wangeyo, wabedo caden ikom gin ma waneno, ento wun pe wuye lok ma watito botwu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" /><char style="wj">Ka atitiwu lok me lobo man, wun pe wuye, ci wubiye ningning ka atitiwu lok me polo?</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" /><char style="wj">Pe tye ngat mo mayam ocito iwi polo, kono en ma ceng olor piny nia ki i polo, en aye Wod pa dano, ma oa ki i polo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:9">Wel 21:9</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Kit macalo Moses yam otingo twol malo i tim ca, kitmeno Wod pa dano bene myero kitinge malo,</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" /><char style="wj">wek dano ducu ma ye en gunong kwo ma pe tum.</char><verse eid="JHN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />
    <char style="wj">Pien Lubanga yam omaro lobo kumeno, piman omiyo iye Wode acel keken, wek dano ducu ma ye en pe oto, ento obed ki kwo ma pe tum.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" /><char style="wj">Lubanga pe ooro Wode i lobo ni ongol kop ikom lobo, ento wek lobo olare pi en.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" /><char style="wj">Ngat ma ye en pe dong kingolo kop ikome, ento ngat ma pe ye en, dong kingolo kop oloye con; pien pe oye Wod pa Lubanga acel keken.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" /><char style="wj">Ngolo kop tye kit man, dero con obino i lobo, ento dano gumaro piny macol makato dero, pien timgi rac.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" /><char style="wj">Pien dano ducu ma timo gin marac dag dero, pe bino i dero, wek time pe onen kamaleng.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" /><char style="wj">Ento ngat ma timo gin me ada bino i dero, wek tice onen kamaleng, ni en tiyo gin ma Lubanga mito.”</char><verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu gin ki Jon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Ka man otum, Yecu ocito i lobo Judaya kacel ki lupwonyene; ci obedo kwedgi kunu kun batija dano. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Jon bene onongo tye ka batija dano i Aenon, macok ki Calim; pien pii onongo dwong kunu, ci dano gubino, ci en obatijagi. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3">Mat 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17">Mar 6:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:19">Luk 3:19</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:20">20</ref></char></note> Man otime ma pud peya kitweyo Jon i buc. <verse eid="JHN 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Pyem ocake ikin lupwonye mogo pa Jon ki Lajudaya mo ikom lok me lwok me lonye. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Ci gucito bot Jon, guwace ni, “Lapwony, ipo ikom ngat ma ninoca wubedo kwede loka Jordan, ma ibolo lok me caden ikomeni, nen, en tye ka batija dano, dok jo ducu tye kacito bote.” <verse eid="JHN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Jon odok iye ni, “Pe tye ngat mo matwero nongo gin mo pire kene ka pe Lubanga omiye nia ki i polo. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:20">Jon 1:20</ref></char></note> Wun ki komwu onongo wubedo cadena ni yam atito ni, ‘An pe a Kricito ma Lubanga oyero ento kiora akwongo nyime.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Nyako ger obedo pa lanyom; larem lanyom ma cung ki tenge kun winye, ci cwinye bedo yom tutwal pi winyo dwon lanyom. Pimeno an bene apong ki yomcwiny mada kawinyo lok man. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Piman rwome omyero omede, ento rwomma omyero odok piny.”<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngat ma oa i polo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Ngat ma a ki malo dit loyo ducu. Ngat ma a i lobo en dano me lobo, dok bene loko lok me lobo; ento ngat ma a i polo dit loyo ducu. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />En bedo caden ikom gin ma oneno ki ikom gin ma owinyo, ento pe tye ngat mo ma ye lok ma en tito. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Ngat ma ye loke, moko caden ni, Lubanga opong ki ada. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Ngat ma Lubanga ooro loko lok pa Lubanga, pien Lubanga miye Cwiny labongo lapim. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:27">Mat 11:27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:22">Luk 10:22</ref></char></note> Won omaro Wod, ci omiyo jami ducu i cinge. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Dano ma ye Wod tye ki kwo ma pe tum; ngat ma pe winyo dog Wod, pe bineno kwo, ento kiniga pa Lubanga bibedo ikome.<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu ki dako me Camaria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Luparicayo guwinyo ni Yecu tye ka loko dano mapol kun kibatijagi me doko lupwonyene, makato pa Jon. <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />Ento Yecu kikome aye pe obatija dano, ento lupwonyene aye gubatijagi. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Ci ka Yecu owinyo lok man, ci oa ki i lobo Judaya, odok i Galilaya; <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />kun ngolo ki i Camaria. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 33:19">Aca 33:19</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Yoc 24:32</ref></char></note> Ka oo Camaria, ci ocito i taun mo ma nyinge Cukar, ma onongo cok ki poto ma Yakobo yam omiyo bot wode Yucepu. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Wang it pa Yakobo onongo tye kunu; ikare ma Yecu ool ki wot, ci obedo piny inget wang it. Onongo dong tye kakine cawa abicel.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Dako mo me Camaria obino katwomo pii. Ci Yecu owace ni, <char style="wj">“Kong imiya pii amati.”</char> <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus asks for water to drink" file="4400407.TIF" size="col" copy="Anie Volltin" ref="4:7">Yecu olego pii amata</figure> <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Ento lupwonyene onongo gucito i taun kawilo cam. <verse eid="JHN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Ci dako Lacamaria ogamoni, “In Lajudaya ipenya pii ningning, ma kun an a dako me Camaria?” Pien Lujudaya pe giribo kikopo ki atabu ki Lacamaria. <verse eid="JHN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yecu odok iye bot dakonu ni, <char style="wj">“Kono yam ingeyo mot ma Lubanga miyo, dok ka kono iniang ikom ngat ma kwayi pii amatani, kono ikwayo en, kono omiyo ki in pii me kwo.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Ci dakonu odoke iye ni, “Ladit, in pe itye ki gitwomo pii, wang it bene tut. Ibinongo pii meno mamiyo kwo ki kwene? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Kwarowa Yakobo yam omiyowa wang it man, ma omato piine, en ki lutinone ki lwak lime. In itamoni idit ikato kwarowa Yakobo ce?” <verse eid="JHN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Ci Yecu odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“Dano ducu ma mato pii man, orwo dok bineke aye;</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" /><char style="wj">ento dano ma bimato pii ma an abimiye, orwo pe bineke nino ducu. Pii ma an abimiye, bidoko wang it ma gunye i iye nio wa i kwo ma pe tum.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Ci dakonu okwaye ni, “Ladit, miya pii meno wek orwo pe dok oneka, wek pe dok abed kabino wa kany katwomo pii.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Ci Yecu owace ni, <char style="wj">“Cit ilwong cwari, ci idwog kany.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Dako meno odoke iye ni, “An cwara pe.” Ci Yecu owaco ki dakonu ni, <char style="wj">“Iwaco kakare ni cwari pe.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" /><char style="wj">Yam ibedo ki co abic, man ma kombedi itye kwedeni bene pe cwari. Man iwaco giri kakare.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Ci dakonu owace ni, “Ladit, anenoni in giri lanebi. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Kwariwa yam giworo Lubanga iwi got man, ento wun wuwaco ni kabedo ma myero kiwor iye Lubanga tye i Jerucalem.” <verse eid="JHN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Ci Yecu ogamo dog dakonu ni, <char style="wj">“Dako, ye loka; kare bibino ma pe wubiworo Won iwi got man, kadi i Jerucalem.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" /><char style="wj">Wun wuworo gin ma pe wungeyo, wan waworo gin ma wangeyo, pien lare oa ki bot Lujudaya.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" /><char style="wj">Ento kare bibino, dok bene dong oo, ma jo ma woro Lubanga i ada gibiworo Won i cwiny ki ada, pien Won yenyo jo macalo meno me wore.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" /><char style="wj">Lubanga en cwiny, jo ma wore myero guwore i cwiny ki ada.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Dakonu owace ni, “Angeyo ni Meciya bibino” en ma kilwongo Kricito ma Lubanga oyero. “En bibino, ci bititiwa lok ducu.” <verse eid="JHN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yecu odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“An a en ma loko kwedini.”</char><verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Cutcut lupwonyene gubino. Ci guuru pien gunongo en tye kalok ki dako, ento pe tye ngat mo ikin gi ma owaco ki dakonu ni, “Imito gin ango?” Nyo me penyo Yecu ni, “Pingo iloko kwede?” <verse eid="JHN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Ci dakonu oweko agulu piine, odok cen i taun, ci owaco bot dano ni, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Wubin, wunen laco moni ma otita gin ducu mayam atiyo. Man mono pe en aye Kricito ma Lubanga oyero?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Ci dano gua ki i taun, gucito bot Yecu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />I kinenu lupwonyene gubako doggi bote kun giwaco ni, “Lapwony, kong icam ba.” <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Ento en owaco ki gin ni, <char style="wj">“Atye ki cam ma acamo ma wun pe wungeyo.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Omiyo lupwonyene gupenye keken gi ni, “Ngati mo okele cam ce?” <verse eid="JHN 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Ci Yecu owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Cama en aye tiyo gin ma ngat ma oora mito, ki cobo tice.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" /><char style="wj">Wun Lujudaya wutye ki lok ma wuwaco ni, ‘Dong odong dwe angwen keken me cako kac.’ Ento atitiwu ni, wuloke wunen poto maber; wek wunen kit ma cam dong ocek kwede me akaya.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" /><char style="wj">Ngat ma kayo kac dong kitye kacule mucarane, ci en guru nyig cam pi kwo ma pe tum, wek laco kodi ki lakayone igi obed yom kacel.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" /><char style="wj">Pien carolok man tye kakare ni, ‘Laco kodi pat, ki lakac bene pat.’</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" /><char style="wj">Ceng aorowu ka kayo kac i poto mayam pe wucane ka coyo iye kodi; jo mukene gucane iye, ento wun aye wunongo magoba i canegi.”</char><verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Lucamaria mapol ma i taun meno guye Yecu pi lok pa dakonu, pien en onongo owaco ki gin ni, “Laco man otita gin ducu mayam an atiyo.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Ci Lucamaria gubino bote, gukwaye ni kong myero obed kwedgi; ci en orii kunu pi nino aryo. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Jo mukene mapol guye en pi loke. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Ci guwaco bot dakonu ni, “Kombedi pe waye pi loki ma itito botwani keken, ento pien dong wawinyo giwa ki itwa, dok watyeko niang ni, adada laco man en aye Lalar me lobo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocango latin pa ladit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Lacen ma nino aryo meno okato, Yecu ocito i Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:57">Mat 13:57</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:4">Mar 6:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:24">Luk 4:24</ref></char></note> Pien Yecu kikome onongo otito ni, <char style="wj">“Pe tye lanebi mo ma kiworo i lobo tugi.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:23">Jon 2:23</ref></char></note> Ka Yecu obino i Galilaya, ci Lugalilaya gujole, pien guneno gin ducu ma en otiyo i Jerucalem ikare me karama, pien gin bene ceng gucito kakwero Karama me Kato.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:46: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 2:1-11">Jon 2:1-11</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ci Yecu dok odok cen i Kana me Galilaya kama yam en oloko iye pii odoko kongo bwino. Yam onongo tye latic mo madit i kal pa rwot ma kom wode lit i Kapernaum. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Ka owinyo ni Yecu oa i Judaya, obino i Galilaya, ci ocito obako doge bote ni obin ocang wode, pien onongo dong cok to. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yecu odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“Wun pe wubiye loka kadi matidi mo ka pe wuneno lanyut ki tango.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Latic madit owace ni, “Ladit, bin ma peya latina oto.” <verse eid="JHN 4:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Ci Yecu owace ni, <char style="wj">“Cit giri, wodi bikwo.”</char> Dano meno oye lok ma Yecu owace, ci ocito. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Ka pud tye i yo, ci orwate ki lutice. Ci guwace ni, “Latini dong kome okee woko.” <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Ci en openyogi cawa mene ma twone ocako dok cen iye, ci gin gugamo ni, “Laworo cawa abiro aye lyeto oa ki ikome.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Ci wone oniang ni meno aye cawa ma Yecu owace iye ni, <char style="wj">“Wodi bikwo.”</char> Omiyo en ki jo ma i ode ducu guye. <verse eid="JHN 4:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Man obedo lanyut me aryo ma Yecu otiyo ikare ma oa ki i Judaya, ci ocito i Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocango dano i dog kut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Lacen inge man, Yecu ocito i Jerucalem pi nino madit pa Lujudaya ma onongo tye.<verse eid="JHN 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />I Jerucalem, yam tye kut mo ma kilwongo i leb jo Ibru ni Betecaida inget Dogcel me Romo, matye iye bolo abic. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Lwak lutwo mapol onongo butu iye, lutowang, lungolo ki lugoro, ma gikuru twage me pii. Pien kare mogo lamalaika pa Rwot bino i kut ci twago i pii. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />Piman ngat ma okwongo lute i pii ma pud kitwago atwagani aye cang ki ikom kit two ducu mayam tye ikome. <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Laco mo onongo tye kunu ma two dong orii ikome pi mwaka pyere adek wiye aboro. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Yecu onene ka obutu piny, dok ongeyo ni en orii kunu pi kare malac, ci openye ni, <char style="wj">“Imito icang?”</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Ci latwo ogamo ni, “Ladit, pe atye ki ngat mo kany matwero luta i kut ka pii otwage. Ka atye ka komo me donyo, ngat mukene dok rune oyot kwongo donyo woko.” <verse eid="JHN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Ci Yecu odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“A malo, ikwany gibutuni, iciti.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Cutcut laco meno otugi cang woko; ci okwanyo gibutune, ci ocito gire.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Man otime i ceng Cabit, <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:19">Nek 13:19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:21">Jer 17:21</ref></char></note> omiyo Lujudaya guwaco ki laco ma kicangoni ni, “Tin ceng Cabit, piman cik pe ye ni iting gibutuni.” <verse eid="JHN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Ento en odok iye ki gin ni, “Ngat ma ocanga aye owaca ni, ‘Ting gibutuni iciti.’” <verse eid="JHN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Ci gupenye ni, “Laco meno ma owaci ni, ‘Ting gibutuni icitini’, en anga?” <verse eid="JHN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Ento laco ma kicangoni onongo pe ngeyo ngat ma ocange, pien Yecu onongo opuce ki ikin lwak ma opong kunu ci ocito gire woko. <verse eid="JHN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Lacen Yecu ononge i Ot pa Lubanga, ci owace ni, <char style="wj">“Nen, dong icang woko, pe dok i mede katimo bal, wek gin marac makato meno pe opot ikomi.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Laconu ocito, otito bot Lujudaya ni, “Yecu aye ocanga.” <verse eid="JHN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />En aye gin ma omiyo Lujudaya gulibo Yecu, pien otimo jami magi i ceng Cabit. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Ento Yecu odok ki gin iye ni, <char style="wj">“Wora tiyo nino ducu, an bene myero atii kitmeno.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Lok man omiyo Lujudaya dok gumede kayenyo yo me neke, pe pi turu cik me Cabit keken, ento bene pi lwongo Lubanga ni Wone, kit man miyo en bedo rom ki Lubanga.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Twero pa Wod</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Ci Yecu odok iye ni, <char style="wj">“Adada awaciwu ni, Wod pe twero tiyo gin mo pire kene, ento tiyo gin maneno Won tiyo; pien gin ma en tiyo, Wod bene tiyo kitmeno.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" /><char style="wj">Won maro Wod, ci nyute gin ducu ma en tiyo; dok binyute tic madito makato magi, wek wuur.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" /><char style="wj">Kitmacalo Won cero jo ma oto, dok miyogi kwo, kitmeno Wod bene miyo kwo bot jo ma en mito.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" /><char style="wj">Won pe ngolo kop ikom dano mo, ento dong otyeko miyo twer me ngolo kop ducu bot Wod,</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" /><char style="wj">wek dano ducu gumii woro ikom Wod, kit macalo gimiyo woro ikom Won. Ngat ma pe miyo woro ikom Wod, nongo bene pe miyo woro ikom Won ma ceng oore.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" /><char style="wj">Adada awaciwu ni, dano ma winyo loka, ma ye ngat ma oora, tye ki kwo ma pe tum; pe kibingolo kop ikome, ento dong oa i to, oo i kwo.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />
    <char style="wj">Adada awaciwu ni, kare bibino, dok bene dong oo, ma jo ma oto i cwiny biwinyo iye dwon Wod pa Lubanga; jo ma biwinyo dok biye bikwo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" /><char style="wj">Pien macalo kwo a ki bot Won, kitmeno en bene omiyo kwo a ki bot Wod,</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" /><char style="wj">dok bene omiye twer me ngolo kop, pien en Wod pa dano.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" /><char style="wj">Pe wuur lok man; pien kare bibino ma jo ducu ma oto biwinyo iye dwone</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Dan 12:2</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">ci gibikati woko. Jo ma ceng gutimo maber bidonyo i cer me kwo, ki jo ma ceng gutimo marac gibicer ci kibingolo kop loyogi.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Caden pa Yecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />
    <char style="wj">An pe atwero tiyo gin mo ki twerona pira kena; angolo kop kit ma awinyo wora waca; kop ma angolo tye atir, pien pe ayenyo yo me tiyo gin ma iya mito pira kena, ento ma ngat ma ceng oora mito.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" /><char style="wj">Ka abolo lok me caden ikoma kena, ci lok ma abolo pe bedo me ada.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" /><char style="wj">Tye ngat mukene ma en aye cadena, angeyo ni lok me caden ma en bolo ikoma obedo lok me ada.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:19-27">Jon 1:19-27</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 3:27-30">3:27-30</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Wun ceng wucwalo kwena bot Jon, ci en oboliwu lok me ada me caden.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" /><char style="wj">Pe mite ni kong omyero abed tye ki dano ma gibolo lok me caden ikoma; ento awaciwu lok magi wek wulare.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" /><char style="wj">Jon yam obedo calo tara ma kicwinyo, ma lyel, dok onongo wumito bedo ki yomcwiny pi kare manok i dero mace.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" /><char style="wj">Ento atye ki lok me caden ma pire dit makato pa Jon; pien tic ma Won omiya me acoba, aye magi kikome ma atye katiyogi, dok gin aye gubedo caden ikoma ni Won aye oora.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luk 3:22</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Dok Won ma ceng oora en kikome obedo cadena. Wun yam pe wuwinyo dwone, pe wuneno wa calle;</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" /><char style="wj">dok pe wubedo ki loke i iwu, pien pe wuye ngat ma en ooro.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" /><char style="wj">Wuyenyo i ginacoya, pien wutamo ni i gin wutye ki kwo ma pe tum, kun gin aye caden ma tito lok ikoma.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" /><char style="wj">Ento wukwero bino bota, wek wulim kwo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" /><char style="wj">An pe alimo deyo ki bot dano,</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" /><char style="wj">ento angeyo ni pe wutye ki mar pa Lubanga i iwu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" /><char style="wj">An abino inying Wora, ento wun pe wujola; ka ngat mukene obino inyinge kene, wun wubijole.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" /><char style="wj">Wun wumito ni wulim pak ki bot luwotwu, ento pe wuteme me limo pak ma a ki bot Lubanga ma en acel keken; ci wutwero ye loka ningning kono?</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" /><char style="wj">Pe wutam ni abidotowu bot Won; ngat ma dotowu en aye Moses, ma wun wugeno.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" /><char style="wj">Ka kono onongo wuye Moses, kono onongo wuye an bene; pien en ocoyo lok ikoma.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" /><char style="wj">Ento ka pe wuye lok ma en ocoyo, ci wubiye ningning lok ma an atitiwu?”</char><verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu opito jo alip abic</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mar 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9:10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Lacen inge man, Yecu ocito loka nam Galilaya, ma en aye nam me Tiberia. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Lwak madwong gulube, pien ceng guneno lanyut ma en otiyo ikom lutwo. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Yecu oito malo iwi got, ci obedo piny kunu kacel ki lupwonyene. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Karama me Kato, ma en nino madit pa Lujudaya, onongo dong cok. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Ka Yecu oilo wange, ci oneno lwak madwong matye kabino bote, ci openyo Pilipo ni, <char style="wj">“Wabiwilo cam ki kwene wek jo man gucam?”</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />En oloko lok man pi teme, pien en kikome onongo ngeyo gin ma ebitiyo. <verse eid="JHN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Pilipo odoke iye ni, “Bimite cente makato denari miya aryo wek cam orom ngat acel acel manoknok.” <verse eid="JHN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Ngat acel ikin lupwonyene, en Anderiya omin Cimon Petero, owace ni, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Latin awobi mo tye kany, matye ki mugati abic me cayiri, ki rec aryo. Ento magi pe biromo lwak marom man” <verse eid="JHN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Ci Yecu owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Wuwek lwak gubed piny.”</char> Lum onongo olot madwong adada ikabedo meno. Ci dano gubedo piny; ci onongo tye co ma welgi romo alip abic. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Lacen Yecu okwanyo mugati, opwoyo, ci opoko bot jo ma gubedo piny, ki rec bene, kit macalo gimito. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Ka dong guyeng, ci Yecu owaco bot lupwonyene ni, <char style="wj">“Wucok ngide ma odong, wek cam mo pe olanye.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Ci gucoko ngide, opongo aduku apar wiye aryo ki ikom mugati abic me cayiri ma lwak gucamo odong. <verse eid="JHN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Ka lwak guneno lanyut ma en otiyo, guwaco ni, “Adada, man en lanebi meno ma omyero obin i loboni.”<verse eid="JHN 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Ka Yecu oniang ni gimito bino kamake tektek pi kete me bedo Rwot, ci olwi, ocito iwi got kakene.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu owoto iwi pii nam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mar 6:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Ka piny oyutu, ci lupwonyene gucito i dog nam, <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />gudonyo i yeya, gucako ngolo nam me cito Kapernaum. Piny onongo dong col, ento Yecu onongo peya obino botgi. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Nam otinge pi yamo ma onongo tye kakodo. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Ka onongo dong gucero yeya gucito kama bore romo mairo adek nyo angwen, ci guneno Yecu ka tye kawot iwi nam ki tyene kun bino i yeya, ci lworo omakogi. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Ento en owacigi ni, <char style="wj">“Pe wulwor, an enu!”</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Omiyo guye odonyo i yeya. Cutcut yeya oo iwi tera kama gitye kacito iye.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lwak guyenyo Yecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Orwone jo ma onongo gudong loka nam tungcel guneno ni yeya acel keken aye odong kunu. Gin gungeyo ni Yecu pe oito i yeya kacel ki lupwonyene, ento lupwonyene ceng gucito ken gi. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Kadi bed kumeno, yeya mukene ma gia Tiberia gubino cok ki kabedo kama dano gucamo iye mugati ingeye ma Rwot otyeko miyo pwoc. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Ka lwak guneno ni Yecu pe kunu, kadi wa lupwonyene bene, gin ki komgi guito i yeya, ci gucito Kapernaum kayenyo Yecu.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu en mugati me kwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Ka lwak gunongo Yecu loka nam tung ca, ci gupenye ni, “Lapwony, ibino kany awene?” <verse eid="JHN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yecu odok ki gin iye ni, <char style="wj">“Adada awaciwu ni, wutye ka yenya pe ni pien yam wuneno lanyut, ento ni pien wucamo mugati, wuyeng.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" /><char style="wj">Pe wutii pi cam ma top wokoni, ento pi cam ma rii nio wa i kwo ma pe tum, ma Wod pa dano bimiyowu; pien Lubanga Won oketo lanen mere ikome.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Gin dok gupenye ni, “Myero watim gin ango wek watii tic pa Lubanga?” <verse eid="JHN 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Ci Yecu odok iye botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Tic ma Lubanga mito ni wutim en aye ni wubed ki niye ikom ngat ma en ooro.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Ci Gupenye ni, “Lanyut ango ma in ibitiyo, wek wanen, ci waye in? Tic ango ma in ibitiyo? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:4">Nia 16:4</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 16:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:24">Jab 78:24</ref></char></note> Kwariwa yam gucamo mugati i tim, kit ma kiwaco i ginacoya ni, ‘Omiyogi mugati me acama ma oa ki i polo.’” <verse eid="JHN 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yecu ogamo doggi ni, <char style="wj">“Adada awaciwu ni, Moses yam pe omiyowu mugati ma oa ki i polo; ento Wora en aye miyowu mugati me ada nia ki i polo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" /><char style="wj">Pien mugati pa Lubanga en mugati ma bino piny nia ki i polo, mamiyo kwo ki lobo.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Ci lwak guwace ni, “Rwot, miwa mugati meno nino ducu.”<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Ci Yecu owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“An a mugati me kwo; ngat ma bino bota, kec pe bineke; ngat ma ye an, orwo pe dok bineke matwal.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" /><char style="wj">Ento yam atito botwu ni, wun dong wunena, ento pe wuye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" /><char style="wj">Dano ducu ma Wora omiya bibino bota; ngat ma bino bota, pe abiryeme.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" /><char style="wj">Pien dong pe alor piny ki i polo katiyo gin ma iya mito pira kena, ento katiyo gin ma ngat mayam oora mito.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" /><char style="wj">Man obedo mit pa ngat ma oora, ni ikom dano ducu ma en omiya pe ngat mo orweny, ento acergi woko ducu inino me agiki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" /><char style="wj">Pien wora mito ni dano ducu maneno Wod, ma ye en, myero gunong kwo ma pe tum; ci an abicerogi woko inino me agiki.”</char><verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Lujudaya gungur ikome pien owaco ni, <char style="wj">“An a mugati ma olor piny nia i polo.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Ci guwaco ni, “Man pe Yecu, wod pa Yucepu, ma wone ki mine wangeyo? Pingo en dok waco ni, ‘An alor piny nia i polo’?” <verse eid="JHN 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Ci Yecu odok iye ki gin ni, <char style="wj">“Pe wungur ikinwu kenwu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" /><char style="wj">Dano mo pe twero bino bota, ka Wora mayam oora pe okele bota, ci an bene abicere woko inino me agiki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:13">Ica 54:13</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Kicoyo i buk pa lunebi ni, ‘Lubanga bipwonyogi ducu.’ Dano ducu ma winyo lok ki bot Won, ce omako loke, bino bota.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" /><char style="wj">Pe ni ngat mo yam oneno Won kono ngat mayam oa ki bot Lubanga en aye oneno Won.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" /><char style="wj">Adada awaciwu ni, ngat ma ye an tye ki kwo ma pe tum.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" /><char style="wj">An a mugati me kwo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" /><char style="wj">Kwariwu yam gucamo mana i tim, ento guto woko.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" /><char style="wj">Man en mugati ma lor piny nia i polo, ma ka dano mo ocamo, pe bito.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" /><char style="wj">An a mugati makwo, ma olor piny nia i polo; ka ngat mo ocamo mugati man, en bibedo kwo nakanaka. Mugati ma abimiyo en aye koma, ma amiyo wek lobo obed ki kwo.”</char><verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Man omiyo Lujudaya guero pyem ikin gi keken gi, kun giwaco ni, “Dano man twero miyowa kome me acama ningning?” <verse eid="JHN 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Ci Yecu owacigi ni, <char style="wj">“Adada awaciwu ni, ka pe wucamo kom Wod pa dano, dok bene ka pe wumato remone, ci pe wubibedo ki kwo i iwu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" /><char style="wj">Ngat ma camo koma, dok bene mato remona, tye ki kwo ma pe tum, ci an abicere woko inino me agiki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" /><char style="wj">Pien koma en cam me ada, dok remona en ginamata me ada.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" /><char style="wj">Ngat ma camo koma, dok bene mato remona, bedo i an, dok an bene abedo i en.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" /><char style="wj">Macalo Won makwo ceng oora, kun an abedo kwo pi Won, kitmeno ngat ma cama bikwo bene pira.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" /><char style="wj">Man en mugati ma olor piny nia i polo, pe kit mugati mayam kwariwu gucamo, ci lacen guto woko; ento ngat ma camo mugati man bibedo kwo nakanaka.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Yecu oloko lok magi ikare ma en pwonyo i kacoke i Kapernaum.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok me kwo ma pe tum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Lupwonyene mapol guwinyo lok man ci guwaco ni, “Man lok matek; anga matwero lubune?” <verse eid="JHN 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Ento Yecu ongeyo ki i cwinye kene ni lupwonyene gitye kangur ikom lok man, ci openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Lok man obalo tamwu woko ce?</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" /><char style="wj">Bibedo ningning ka kono wuneno Wod pa dano kun ito me dok kama yam en tye iye con?</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" /><char style="wj">Gin mamiyo kwo en aye Cwiny pa Lubanga, teko me kom pe konyo gin mo; lok ducu ma awaciwu gin aye kelo kwo pien a ki bot Cwiny Maleng.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" /><char style="wj">Ento tye jo mogo ikinwu ma pe giye.”</char> Pien nia i acaki Yecu onongo ngeyo jo meno ma pe ye, ki ngat ma bidobe. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />En dok owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Man en gin ma omiyo ceng atitiwu ni, pe tye ngat mo matwero bino bota, ka Won pe oye ni otime.”</char><verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Cake ikare meno, lupwonyene mapol gudok cen, pe dok gubedo kawot kacel kwede. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Piman Yecu openyo jone apar wiye aryoni ni, <char style="wj">“Wun bene wumito dok cen?”</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Ci<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:68: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:16">Mat 16:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:29">Mar 8:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:20">Luk 9:20</ref></char></note> Cimon Petero ogamo doge ni, “Rwot, wabicito bot anga? In itye ki lok me kwo ma pe tum. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Wan waye, dok watyeko niang ni, in i ngat Maleng pa Lubanga.” <verse eid="JHN 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Ci Yecu odok ki gin iye ni, <char style="wj">“Ceng pe ayerowu wun apar wiye aryo? Ento ngat acel ikinwu pa Catan.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />En onongo oloko ikom Juda wod pa Cimon me Keriot, ngat acel ikin jonu apar wiye aryoni, ma bidobe.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu ki omegine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />I nge man, Yecu obedo kawot ikin Galilaya; pe omito cito i Judaya, pien Lujudaya onongo gimito neke. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:34">Lev 23:34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:13">Nwo 16:13</ref></char></note> Nino madito me kwero Kayo kac pa Lujudaya onongo cok. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Ci omegine guwace in, “A ki kany, icit i Judaya, wek lupwonyeni gunen tic ma in itiyo. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Pe tye dano mo ma tiyo tic i mung, ka en kikome mito ni dano gungeye. Kit ma itye katiyo tic magi, nyute keni wek wilobo ducu gungeyi.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Pien kadi omegine kikome bene onongo pe guye en. <verse eid="JHN 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Ci Yecu owacigi ni, <char style="wj">“Karena pud peya oo, ento karewu nino ducu tye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" /><char style="wj">Lobo pe twero kwerowu, ento okwero an, pien an atucu lok ikome, ni tice ducu racu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" /><char style="wj">Wun wucit kakwero nino madito; an pe abicito inino madito magi, pien karena peya oromo maber.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Yecu oloko lok man botgi, ci odong i Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu inino me karama me Kac</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Ento ka omegine dong gutyeko cito pi nino madito, ci en bene ocito, pe atyer, ento i mung. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Lujudaya gubedo kayenye inino madito kun gipenyo ni, “En tye kwene?” <verse eid="JHN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Lwak onongo gitye ki nguru ikome tutwal. Jo mukene guwaco ni, “En gire dano maber,” ento jo mukene ni, “Pe, en rwenyo lwak.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Ento pe tye ngat mo ma waco nyinge kamaleng, pien onongo gilworo Lujudaya.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Ka dong oo i dye nino madito, ci Yecu ocito i ot pa Lubanga, ci ocako pwonyo dano. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Lujudaya guuru, kun giwaco ni, “Dano man onongo ngec madwong kit man ningning, kun bene pe okwano?” <verse eid="JHN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Yecu odok iye ki gin ni, <char style="wj">“Pwony ma apwonyoni pe obedo mera kikoma, ento pa ngat ma ceng oora.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" /><char style="wj">Ka ngat mo mito tiyo gin ma Lubanga mito, en biniang kace pwony man oa ki bot Lubanga, nyo ka aloko pira kena.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" /><char style="wj">Ngat ma loko pire kene yenyo deyone pire kene. Ento ngat ma yenyo deyo pi ngat ma oore, bedo ki ada dok bene gin ma pe atir pe i en.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" /><char style="wj">Moses ceng pe omiyowu cik? Ento pe tye ngat mo ikinwu ma gwoko cik. Pingo wumito neka?”</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Lwak gudok iye ni, “In giri itye ki cen! Anga ma mito neki?” <verse eid="JHN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yecu ogamo doggi ni, <char style="wj">“Yam atiyo tic acel, ci wun ducu wuuru.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Lev 12:3</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:10">Aca 17:10</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Moses ceng omiyowu cik me lire, kadi bed pe oa ki bot Moses, ento ki bot kwariwu, ci wun bene wuliro dano i ceng Cabit.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:9">Jon 5:9</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ka kiliro latin awobi i ceng Cabit, wek pe kitur cik pa Moses, ci pingo iwu wang ikoma pi cango dano i ceng Cabit?</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" /><char style="wj">Pe wungol kop pi neno ki wang, ento wungol kop atir.”</char><verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Man mono aye Kricito?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Jo mogo me Jerucalem guwaco ni, “Man pe laco ma kimito nekoni? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Nen, en tye kalok kamaleng, ento gin bene gipeke kaloko lok mo marac ikome. Luloc tika giniang ni man en Kricito ma Lubanga oyero? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Ento wan wangeyo kama dano man oa iye; ka Kricito binen, pe tye dano mo ma bingeyo kama en oa iye.” <verse eid="JHN 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Ikare ma Yecu obedo ka pwony i Ot pa Lubanga, en odange, kun penyo ni, <char style="wj">“Wun tika wungeya, dok wungeyo kama an aa iye? An pe abino pira kena. Ngat ma oora en me ada, wun pe wungeye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" /><char style="wj">Ento an angeye, pien aa ki bote, en aye oora.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Ci gumito make, ento pe tye ngat mo ma oketo cinge ikome, pien karene onongo peya oromo. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Ento jo mapol ikin lwak guye en ci guwaco ni, “Ka Kricito ma Lubanga oyero binen, ci en mono bitiyo lanyut mapol makato ma dano man tiyo?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kicwalo acikari kamako Yecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Luparicayo guwinyo ka lwak tye kangur ikom Yecu, omiyo ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki Luparicayo gucwalo acikari kamake. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Ci Yecu owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Pud dok abibedo kwedwu pi kare manok, lacen abidok bot ngat mayam oora.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" /><char style="wj">Wubiyenya, ento pe wubinonga, pien kama abedo iye, wun pe wutwero oo iye.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Ci Lujudaya gupenye keken gi ni, “Dano man mito cito kweneka, ma wan pe wabinongeni? En mito cito bot jo mewa ma guket ata ikin jo Grik, ka pwonyo jo Grik ce? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Man teloke ningo, ni, ‘Wubiyenya, ento pe wubinonga,’ dok ni, ‘Kama abedo iye, wun pe wutwero oo iye’?”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kulu me pii mamiyo kwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:37: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 23:36">Lev 23:36</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Inino me agiki me karama, ma en aye nino madit, Yecu oa malo, ci odange, kun waco ni, <char style="wj">“Ngat ma orwo pii neko, en myero obin bota.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 47:1">Eje 47:1</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 14:8">Jek 14:8</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ngat ma ye an myero omati, kit macalo ginacoya waco, ‘Kulu me pii mamiyo kwo bimol nia i iye.’”</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Yecu oloko lok man ikom Cwiny Maleng, ma jo ma giye en binongo. Ikare meno onongo Cwiny Maleng peya kimiyo, pien onongo Yecu peya kiketo deyo ikome.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Apokapoka ikin lwak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Ka guwinyo lok magi, ci jo mogo ikin lwak guwaco ni, “Adada, nye man en lanebi kikome.” <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Ci jo mukene guwaco ni, “Man gire Kricito ma Lubanga oyero.” Ento jo mukene dok guwaco ni, “Kricito ma Lubanga oyero pe a ki i Galilaya! <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12">2 Cam 7:12</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 5:2">Mik 5:2</ref></char></note> Pien ginacoya tito ni, Kricito ma Lubanga oyero a ki i anywali pa Daudi, ki i Beterekem, i taun mayam Daudi bedo iye” <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Pimeno apokapoka obedo ikin lwak pire. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Jo mogo ikin gi gumito make, ento pe tye ngat mo ma oketo cinge ikome.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ludito pa Lujudaya pe guye Yecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Acikari gudok cen bot ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki Luparicayo. Ci gupenyogi ni, “Pingo pe wukele?” <verse eid="JHN 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Ci acikari gugamo doggi ni, “Pe tye ngat mo mayam oloko macalo dano man.” <verse eid="JHN 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Ci Luparicayo gudok iye botgi ni, “Wun bene kityeko rwenyowu woko ce? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Dong mono wunongo ngat mo ikin luloc nyo ikin Luparicayo ma guye en? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Ento lwak man ma kwiya cik pa Moses dong kicenogi woko.” <verse eid="JHN 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:50: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:1">Jon 3:1</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 3:2">2</ref></char></note> Nikodemo mayam ocito bot Yecu, ma en bene ngat acel ikin Luparicayo, openyogi ni, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Cik mewa mono ye ni kingol kop ikom dano ka peya kiwinyo lok ma a ki idoge, wek kiniang ikom gin ma en timo?” <verse eid="JHN 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Ci gudoke iye ni, “In bene ia ki i Galilaya ce? Kong iyeny i ginacoya ci ibineno ni pe tye lanebi mo ma bia ki i Galilaya.” [<verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Ci ngat acel acel odok i ode.]<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s1">Dako ma kimako katimo abor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Dano ducu gudok paco ento Yecu ocito wa iwi got Jeituni. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Orwone odiko con Yecu dok odok i Ot pa Lubanga. Jo ducu gucoke bote, ci en obedo piny, ci opwonyogi. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Lupwonycik ki Luparicayo gukelo dako mo ma kimako katimo abor ci gukete idyere. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Guwace ni, “Lapwony, dako man kimako katimo abor, kinonge iye kikome. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:10">Lev 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 22:22-24">Nwo 22:22-24</ref></char></note> I Cik Moses ocikowa ni, dano macalo man myero kicel woko ki gweng. In kono ingolo ningning?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Gin guwaco lok man pi teme, wek ginong lok ma gibidote kwede. Ento Yecu okule piny, ocoyo ingom ki lwete. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Ka gumede kapenye, en oile malo, ci owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Ngat mo ikinwu ma peke ki bal okwong cele ki gweng.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />En dok okule piny, ci ocoyo ingom ki lwete. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Ka guwinyo lok man, ci guket ki acel acel, kun ocake ki ikom jo madito; ci Yecu odong kene gin ki dakonu ma ocung inyime. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Ci Yecu oile, ci openyo dakonu ni, <char style="wj">“Gin kono gitye kwene? Pe tye ngat mo ma ongolo kop oloyi?”</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Ci dakonu ogamo ni, “Pe tye ngat mo ladit.” Yecu owaco ni, <char style="wj">“An bene pe abingolo kop loyi. Cit giri; ento cake tin pe dok ibal.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu en dero me lobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:14">Mat 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 9:5">Jon 9:5</ref></char>
    </note> Yecu dok oloko ki Luparicayo kun waco ni, <char style="wj">“An a dero pa dano ducu me lobo; ngat ma luba pe biwot i colpiny, ento bibedo ki dero me kwo.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:31">Jon 5:31</ref></char></note> Ci Luparicayo gukwero loke woko kun giwace ni, “In giri itucu lok me caden ikomi kekeni, dok caden ma i tucu ikomini pe me ada.” <verse eid="JHN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Ci Yecu odok ki gin iye ni, <char style="wj">“Kadi bed an atucu lok me caden ikoma kekena, ento lok ma atucuni tye me ada, pien an angeyo kama aa iye, ki kama acito iye, ento wun pe wungeyo kama aa iye, ki kama acito iye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" /><char style="wj">Wun wungolo kop malube ki kit pa dano, ento an pe angolo kop ikom ngat mo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" /><char style="wj">Kadi bed angol kop, ento kop ma an angolo tye atir, pien pe angolo kop kena, ento an angolo kop kacel ki ngat ma oora.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" /><char style="wj">I cikwu kicoyo ni, lok me caden pa dano aryo kace orwate bedo ada.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" /><char style="wj">An atucu lok me caden ikoma kekena, dok bene Wora ma oora bene cadena.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Ci Luparicayo gupenye ni, “Woru tye kwene?” Ci Yecu odok ki gin iye ni, <char style="wj">“Wun pe wungeyo an, dok bene pe wungeyo Wora. Kono onongo wungeya, kono wungeyo Wora bene.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Yecu oloko lok man ikare ma pwonyo dano i Ot pa Lubanga, matye cok ki kama kigwoko iye lim tyer, ento pe tye ngat mo ma omake, pien karene onongo peya oromo.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kama acito iye wun pe wutwero cito iye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Yecu dok owaco ki gin ni, <char style="wj">“An abicito woko. Wun wubiyenya, ento wubito i balwu. Kama acito iye, wun pe wutwero cito iye.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Piman Lujudaya guwaco ni, “En bineke kene ce, pien waco ni, ‘Kama acito iye wun pe wutwero cito iye’?” <verse eid="JHN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Ci Yecu owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wun jo ma kinywalowu piny i lobo kany, ento an aa ki malo; wun jo me lobo kany, ento an pe a dano me lobo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" /><char style="wj">En ma omiyo awaco botwu ni, wun wubito i balwu. Ada wubito i balwu ka pe wuye ni An aye a En.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Ci gupenyeni, “In anga?” Yecu odok ki gin iye ni, <char style="wj">“An a ngat mayam atitiwu con nia i acaki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" /><char style="wj">Atye ki lok mapol me aloka ikomwu, ki kop mapol me angola; ento ngat ma oora en me ada, ma omiyo atito ki jo ma i lobo gin madong awinyo ki bote.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Pe guniang ni en tye ka titigi pi Lubanga Won. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Omiyo Yecu owaco ki gin ni, <char style="wj">“Ka dong wutingo Wod pa dano malo me aneka ikom yat, ci wubiniang ni An aye a En, dok ni pe atiyo gin mo pira kena, ento aloko gin ma Wora opwonya iye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" /><char style="wj">Ngat ma oora tye kweda; pe oweka kena, pien nino ducu atiyo gin ma iye mito.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Jo mapol ma guwinye kaloko lok man guye en.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok me ada bigonyowu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Yecu owaco bot Lujudaya ma guye en ni, <char style="wj">“Ka wumoko i loka, ci wun lupwonyena adada;</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" /><char style="wj">miyo wubingeyo lok me ada, ci lok me ada bigonyowu.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:9">Mat 3:9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:8">Luk 3:8</ref></char></note> Ci gudoke iye ni, “Wan likwayo pa Abraim; ma naka yam peya wabedo opii pa ngat mo. Pingo dong in iwaco ni, ‘Kibigonyowu’?”<verse eid="JHN 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Ci Yecu odok ki gin iye ni, <char style="wj">“Adada awaciwu ni, dano ducu ma timo bal, nongo bedo mere i dic me te loc me bal kit macalo opii bedo i dic me te loc pa rwode.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" /><char style="wj">Opii pe bedo latin ma i ot pi nakanaka, ento latin anywali ma laco bedo gire latin ma i ot pi nakanaka.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" /><char style="wj">Piman, kace Wod ogonyowu ci wubibedo agonya atika.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" /><char style="wj">Angeyo ni wun likwayo pa Abraim; ento wumito neka, pien pe wuye pwony ma apwonyowu kwede.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" /><char style="wj">An aloko gin ma aneno ki bot Wora, ento wun wutiyo gin ma wuneno ki bot wonwu.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Ci gudoke iye ni, “Abraim en wonwa.” Ento Yecu owaco ki gin ni, <char style="wj">“Ka onongo wun lutino pa Abraim, kono wun bene wutiyo kit tic acel ma Abraim otiyo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" /><char style="wj">An atye katitiwu lok me ada ma awinyo ki bot Lubanga; ento kombedi wun wumito neka woko. Abraim yam pe otiyo kitmeno do!</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" /><char style="wj">Wun wutye katiyo gin ma wonwu otimo.”</char> Ci gudok iye bote ni, “Wan pe kinywalowa i abor; watye ki wonwa acel keken, en aye Lubanga.” <verse eid="JHN 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Ento Yecu ogamo doggi ni, <char style="wj">“Kono Lubanga wonwu, kono wumara, pien an aa ki bot Lubanga, kombedi dong atye kany; pe abino pira kena, en aye oora.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" /><char style="wj">Wungeyo gin ango ma oweko pe wutwero niang lok ma an awaco botwu? Pien pe wutwero ye lok ma an atito botwu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" /><char style="wj">Wun wua ki bot wonwu, Catan, wumito cobo gin ma wonwu mito. Nia i acaki piny en con laneko, dok pe ocung i ada, pien lok me ada pe i iye. Ka en loko lok goba, nongo en loko malube ki kite, pien en lagoba, dok bene en won goba.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" /><char style="wj">Ento an aloko lok ada en ma omiyo wun pe wuye an.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" /><char style="wj">Anga matye ikinwu matwero moko lok me bal ikoma? Ka atito lok me ada, pingo pe wuye an?</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" /><char style="wj">Ngat ma oa ki bot Lubanga winyo lok pa Lubanga. Gin ma omiyo wun pe wuwinyo, pien pe wua ki bot Lubanga.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ki Abraim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Lujudaya gudoke iye ni, “Wan nene pe wawaco kakare ni, in Lacamaria, dok itye ki cen?” <verse eid="JHN 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Ci Yecu odok ki gin iye ni, <char style="wj">“An pe atye ki cen; ento aworo Wora, wun pe wuwora.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" /><char style="wj">An pe ayenyo deyona pira kena; ento tye ngat mo matye ka yenyone pira dok bene en aye bingolo kop atir pira.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" /><char style="wj">Ento adada awaco botwu ni, ka ngat mo lubu loka, ci pe bito matwal.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Ci Lujudaya gudoke iye ni, “Kombedi dong waniang ni itye ki cen ada! Abraim yam oto, ki lunebi bene guto, ento in iwaco ni, ‘Ka ngat mo lubu loka, ci pe bibilo to matwal.’ <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />In idit ikato kwarowa Abraim, ma ceng otoni? Lunebi bene guto do! In ikete ni in anga?” <verse eid="JHN 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yecu ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“Ka aketo deyo ikoma kena, deyona mwa; Wora aye keto deyo ikoma, en ma wun wuwaco ni Lubangawuni.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" /><char style="wj">Wun pe wungeye; ento an angeye. Ka kono awaco ni pe angeye, kono adoko lagoba macalo wun; ento an angeye, dok alubu loke.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" /><char style="wj">Kwarowu Abraim yam obedo ki yomcwiny ni ebineno ninona; ci oneno, dok cwinye obedo yom matek.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Ci Lujudaya guwace ni, “In ma mwakani bene peya oromo pyerabici, ci iwaconi ineno Abraim?” <verse eid="JHN 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yecu ogamo doggi ni, <char style="wj">“Adada awaciwu ni, ma Abraim pud pe, onongo dong an atye.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Omiyo gukwanyo got me cele; ento Yecu okane, ci okato woko ki i Ot pa Lubanga.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocango laco ma kinywalo ma wange oto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Ikare ma Yecu onongo tye kakato ki i yoo, ci oneno dano mo ma kinywalo ma wange oto. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Ci Lupwonyene gupenye ni, “Lapwony, anga ma obalo, laco man, kece nyo lunyodone, ma omiyo kinywale ma wange oto?” <verse eid="JHN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yecu ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“Laco man pe obalo, kadi lunyodone bene, ento man otime wek tic pa Lubanga onen ikome.</char> <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" /><char style="wj">Myero watii tic pa ngat ma oora ma ceng pud tye; dyewor bibino ma ngat mo pe twero tic.</char> <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:14">Mat 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:12">Jon 8:12</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ka pud atye i lobo, an a dero me lobo.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Ka Yecu oloko lok man, ci ongulu laa piny, ka orubu ki ngom, ci owiro ki wang laconu. <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />Owace ni, <char style="wj">“Citi, ilwok i kut me Ciloam”</char> (ma te loke ni, Ma kioro). En ocito olwoko wange, ci odwogo ma wange dong neno piny. <verse eid="JHN 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Luwote ki jo mayam ginene kun kwayo lim guwaco ni, “Man pe laco ma onongo bedo kun kwayo limi?” <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Jo mogo guwaco ni, “En kikome”; ento jo mukene ni, “Pe, ento cal kwede acala.” Ci laconu ogamo ni, “An enu, do!” <verse eid="JHN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Ci dano gupenye ni, “Wangi oyabe ningning?” <verse eid="JHN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Ci en ogamo ni, “Dano ma kilwongo nyinge ni Yecu aye orubu ngom, owiro ki wanga, ci ocika ni, ‘Cit ilwok i Ciloam.’ Ci ka acito, alwoko, acako neno piny.” <verse eid="JHN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Dok gupenye ni, “En tye kwene?” Ci en ogamo ni, “Pe angeyo.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Luparicayo guyenyo kit ma kicango kwede lawange oto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Ci gukelo dano mayam wange otoni bot Luparicayo. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Nino ma Yecu orubu ngom iye, ci oyabo ki wange, onongo ceng Cabit. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Ci Luparicayo dok gupenye ni, “Wangi oyabe ningning?” En odok ki gin iye ni, “En owiro ngom i wanga, alwoko, ci aneno piny.” <verse eid="JHN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Luparicayo mogo guwaco ni, “Dano man pe oa ki bot Lubanga, pien pe gwoko ceng Cabit.” Ento jo mukene guwaco ni, “Dano ma labalo twero tiyo lanyut marom man?” Omiyo apokapoka obedo ikin gi. <verse eid="JHN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Dok gupenyo dano mayam onongo wange otoni ni, “In itamo lok ango ikome, pien oyabo wangi?” En odok iye ni, “En lanebi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Ento Lujudaya pe guye ni meno aye laco mayam onongo wange otoni, dok bene ni dong neno piny, nio ka kilwongo lunyodo pa dano ma kiyabo wangeni. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Ci Luparicayo gupenyogi ni, “Man aye latinwu ma wuwaco ni kinywale ma wange otoni? Gin ango ma omiyo dong en neno piny kombedi?” <verse eid="JHN 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Ci lunyodone gudok iye ni, “Wangeyo ni man latinwa, dok yam kinywale ma wange oto. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Ento kit ma en ocako neno ki piny kombedini, pe wangeyo; dok wan pe wangeyo ngat ma oyabo wange. Wupenye; en dong dit, en bilok pire kene.” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Lunyodone guwaco lok man pien gulworo Lujudaya, pien onongo Lujudaya guporo lok kacel ni, ka ngat mo otucu ni Yecu en Kricito ma Lubanga oyero, ci kibiryeme woko ki i kacoke. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />En aye gin ma omiyo lunyodone guwaco ni, “En dong dit, wupenye.”<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Pi lok man omiyo gulwongo dano mayam wange otoni tyen me aryo, kun giwace ni, “Mi deyo bot Lubanga; wan wangeyo ni dano man labalo.”<verse eid="JHN 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />En ogamo ni, “Ka en labalo, pe angeyo; gin acel keken ma angeyo, en aye ni, yam onongo wanga oto, ento kombedi dong aneno piny.” <verse eid="JHN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Gin gupenye ni, “En otimi ningning? Oyabo wangi ningning?” <verse eid="JHN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />En odok ki gin iye ni, “Dong atitiwu con, wun pe wuwinyo. Pingo dok pud wumito winyo odoco? Wun bene wumito doko lupwonyene, ce?” <verse eid="JHN 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Ci guyete kun giwaco ni, “In giri aye lapwonyene ento wan giwa lupwonye pa Moses. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Wangeyo ni Lubanga yam oloko ki Moses, ento dano man pe wangeyo kama oa iye.” <verse eid="JHN 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Dano ca odok iye ni, “Man lok me aura tutwal! Wun pe wungeyo kama en oa iye, kun en oyabo wanga! <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Wangeyo ni Lubanga pe winyo lubalo, ento ka ngat ma woro Lubanga, dok tiyo gin ma en mito, Lubanga winye. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Ma naka yam peya owinye ni ngat mo oyabo wang dano mo ma kinywale ma wange oto. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Ka kono dano man onongo pe oa ki bot Lubanga, kono pe otwero timo gin mo wa ki acel.” <verse eid="JHN 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Ci gugamo doge ni, “In ma kinywali i bal kekeni bene ipwonywa?” Ci guryeme woko.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Towang me cwiny</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Ka Yecu owinyo ni kiryeme woko, ci onongo laconu, ci openye ni, <char style="wj">“In iye Wod pa dano?”</char> <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />En odok iye ni, “En anga, ladit, wek aye en?” <verse eid="JHN 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Ci Yecu owace ni, <char style="wj">“Dong inene, en aye ngat matye kalok kwedini.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />En owaco ni, “Aye, Rwot”; ci owore. <verse eid="JHN 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Yecu owace ni, <char style="wj">“An abino i lobo kangolo kop, wek jo ma pe neno piny gunen, ki jo maneno gudok lutowang.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Ci Luparicayo mogo ma onongo cok kwede guwinyo lok man. Ci gupenye ni, “Wan bene wangwa oto ce?” <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Ci Yecu odok iye ni, <char style="wj">“Ka onongo wun wangwu oto, kono pe wutye ki bal; ento wun wuwaco ni, ‘Wan waneno piny’; pimeno balwu pud tye gire.”</char><verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Carolok ikom Lakwat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />
    <char style="wj">“Adada awaciwu ni, ngat ma pe donyo i dwol romo ki i dogola, ento ito ki kamukene, nongo obedo ngat ma lakwo ki layak;</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" /><char style="wj">ento ngat ma donyo ki i dogola, en lakwat romi kikome.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" /><char style="wj">Lagwok dogola yabe kika, dok romi bene giwinyo dwone; ci en lwongo romi ki nyinggi, ci terogi woko.</char><verse eid="JHN 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />
    <char style="wj">Ka dong ocwalogi ducu woko, ci en woto telo nyimgi, kun romi gilube, pien gingeyo dwone.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" /><char style="wj">Pe gilubu welo, ento giringo woko ki bote, pien pe gingeyo dwon welo.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yecu oloko ki gin carolok man, ento pe guniang lok ma en otito botgi.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu en lakwat maber</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Yecu dok owaco ki gin ni, <char style="wj">“Adada awaciwu ni, an a dogola me romi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" /><char style="wj">Jo ducu mayam gubino ma gukwongo nyima, gin lukwo dok luyak; ento romi pe guwinyo dwon gi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" /><char style="wj">An a dogola. Jo ducu ma gidonyo ki bota, gibilare; dok gibidonyo, ka gibikati woko, ci gibinongo cam i olet.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" /><char style="wj">Lakwo pe bino pi lok mo mukene, ento kono pi kwalo, pi neko ki pi tyeko; ento an abino wek gunong kwo, dok gubed kwede madwong.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" /><char style="wj">An lakwat maber. Lakwat maber jalo kwone pi romine.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" /><char style="wj">Ngat ma tiyo pi mucara, ma pe lakwat, ma romi pe mere kikome, ka oneno orudi bino, ci ringo weko romi woko; piman orudi monyogi, ci keyogi woko.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" /><char style="wj">En ringo woko pien tiyo pi mucara keken, pe paro pi romi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" /><char style="wj">An lakwat maber; angeyo romina, gin bene gingeya,</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:27">Mat 11:27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:22">Luk 10:22</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">kit macalo Won ngeya, an bene angeyo Won; weko amiyo kwona pi romina.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" /><char style="wj">Atye ki romina mukene bene, ma gipeke i dwol man; omyero akelgi bene, ci gibiwinyo dwona, dok gibibedo lwak acel ki lakwat acel.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" /><char style="wj">Gin ma omiyo Won mara, pien amiyo kwona wek dok agam odoco.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" /><char style="wj">Pe tye ngat mo ma kwanyo kwona ki bota; amiyo gira pira kena. Atye ki twero me jalo kwona, dok atye ki twero me dwokone dok odoco. Anongo cik man ki bot Wora.”</char><verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Apokapoka dok obedo ikin Lujudaya pi lok man. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Ci jo mapol ki ikin gi guwaco ni, “En tye ki cen, opo apoya; pingo wuwinyo loke?” <verse eid="JHN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Ento jo mukene guwaco ni, “Lok man pe pa dano matye ki cen. Cen twero yabo wang dano ma wange oto?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kikwero Yecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Ikare meno nino madit me kwero Ot pa Lubanga obedo i Jerucalem. Man otime ikare me cwir, <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />ci Yecu onongo tye kawot i Ot pa Lubanga, ite baraja pa Solomon. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Lujudaya gucoke, gurume idyere, ci gupenye ni, “Ibiweko wabedo ki akalakala naka wa awene? Ka in i Kricito ma Lubanga oyero, ci titiwa atir.” <verse eid="JHN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yecu odok ki gin iye ni, <char style="wj">“Atyeko titiwu ento wun pe wuye. Tic ma atiyo inying Wora gin cadena.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" /><char style="wj">Wun pe wuye, pien pe wutye ikin romina.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" /><char style="wj">Romina giwinyo dwona, an angeyogi, gin luba.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" /><char style="wj">Ci amiyogi kwo ma pe tum; gin pe bito matwal, dok pe tye ngat mo ma bimayogi ki i cinga.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" /><char style="wj">Wora ma omiyogi bota dit makato ducu, pe tye ngat mo matwero mayogi ki i cing Won.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" /><char style="wj">An ki Won wan acel.”</char><verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Ci Lujudaya dok gukwanyo got me cele. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Ento Yecu owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Atyeko nyutiwu tic mabeco mapol ma oa ki bot Won; wumito cela ki got pi tic mene?”</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Lev 24:16</ref></char></note> Ento Lujudaya gudoke iye ni, “Pe waceli pi tic mo maber, ento pi yeto Lubanga; pien in i dano adana, ento in ikete keni ni in Lubanga.” <verse eid="JHN 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 82:6">Jab 82:6</ref></char></note> Ci Yecu ogamo doggi ni, <char style="wj">“Pe kicoyo i cik mewu ni, ‘An awaco ni wun lubanga.’</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" /><char style="wj">Ka en lwongo jo ma lok pa Lubanga obino botgi ni gin lubanga kun ginacoya pe twero ture,</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" /><char style="wj">ci wun wutwero waco ningning bot ngat ma Won olonyo, dok ooro i lobo, ni, ‘Iyeto lubanga,’ pien an awaco ni, ‘An a Wod pa Lubanga’?</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" /><char style="wj">Ka pe atiyo tic pa Wora, ci pe omyero wuye an.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" /><char style="wj">Ento kace atiyo tice, kadi bed pe wuye an, ento omyero wuye tic ma atiyo; wek wunge dok wuniang ni Won tye i an, ki an bene atye i Won.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Gin dok gutemo make, ento en opuce woko ki i cinggi.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:40: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 1:28">Jon 1:28</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ci Yecu dok odok cen loka Jordan, ikabedo kama yam Jon okwongo batija dano iye, ci obedo kunu. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Ci jo mapol gubino bote kun giwaco ni, “Jon yam pe otiyo lanyut mo ento lok ducu ma Jon otito ikom dano man obedo me ada.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Ci jo mapol kunu guketo niyegi ikome.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s1">To pa Lajaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 10:38">Luk 10:38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 10:39">39</ref></char>
    </note> Ikare meno onongo tye dano mo ma kome lit i Betania ma nyinge Lajaro. Betania obedo gang ma Maliam gin ki lamine Marta bedo iye. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:3">Jon 12:3</ref></char></note> Man aye Maliam mayam owiro tyen Rwot ki moo, ka dok ojwayo tyene ki yer wiye; omine Lajaro aye onongo kome lit. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Nyimegine gucwalo kwena bote kun giwaco ni, “Rwot, laremi ma imaroni kome lit.” <verse eid="JHN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Ento ka Yecu owinyo kwena man ci owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Two man pe obino pi neke, ento pi kelo deyo bot Lubanga, wek oloke odok gin mamiyo deyo bot Wod pa Lubanga.”</char><verse eid="JHN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Yecu yam maro Marta ki lamine ki Lajaro. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Ento ka owinyo kwena ni Lajaro kome lit, ci dok ogale pi nino aryo ikabedo ma onongo en tye iye. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Lacen owaco bot lupwonyene ni, “Wadoku cen dok i Judaya.” <verse eid="JHN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Ci Lupwonyene gudoke iye ni, “Lapwony, Lujudaya nene gumito celo in ki got, ento man in dok i mito dok cen kunu?” <verse eid="JHN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yecu ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“Cawa me dyeceng pe tye apar wiye aryo? Ka ngat mo woto i dyeceng, ci en pe cato, pien neno dero me lobo man.</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" /><char style="wj">Ento ka ngat mo woto dyewor, ci cato, pien dero pe i iye.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Ci Yecu owaco kit man, ka dok lacen owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Laremwa Lajaro dong onino woko, ento abicito wek acit acoye ki iwang nino.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Ci Lupwonyene guwace ni, “Rwot, ka en onino anina, ci en bibedo maber.” <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Yecu onongo oloko pi to pa Lajaro, ento lupwonyene gutamo ni en oloko pi yweyo me nino. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Lacen Yecu otito atir botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Lajaro dong otyeko to woko;</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" /><char style="wj">ento cwinya yom pirwu pien en oto ma onongo an pe atye kunu, wek wun wuye. Dong wacitu bote.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Ci Tomaci ma te loke ni, Bangi owaco bot lupwonye luwote ni, “Wan bene wacitu, wek wato wunu kacel kwede.”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu en nicer ki kwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Ikare ma Yecu oo kunu, ci onongo ni Lajaro dong orii i lyel nino angwen. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Betania onongo cok ki Jerucalem, mito romo mairo aryo; <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />ci jo mapol ikin Lujudaya onongo gubino bot Marta ki Maliam kakweyo cwinygi pi omin gi. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Ka Marta owinyo ni Yecu tye kabino, ci ocito, oromo kwede, ento Maliam odong, obedo i ot. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Ci Marta owaco bot Yecu ni, “Rwot, kono nene ibedo tye kany, kono omera pe oto. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Dok bene angeyo ni gin ducu ma ibilego ki bot Lubanga kombedi en bimiyi.” <verse eid="JHN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Ci Yecu owace ni, <char style="wj">“Omeru obicer obibedo kwo.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Ci Marta ogamo doge ni, “Angeyo ni en bicer i cer me nino me agiki.” <verse eid="JHN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Ci Yecu owace ni, <char style="wj">“An nicer ki kwo; ngat ma ye an, kadi bed oto, en dok bikwo;</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" /><char style="wj">dok dano ducu makwo ma ye an, pe bito matwal. In iye lok man?”</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />En odok iye ni, “Eyo Rwot; dong aye ni in i Kricito ma Lubanga oyero, Wod pa Lubanga, ma omyero obin i lobo.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu okok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />I ngeye ma Marta oloko lok man, ci ocito olwongo lamine Maliam ci okwile ni, “Lapwony tye kany, en tye kalwongi.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Ka Maliam owinyo lok man, ci oa aruya me cito bote. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Yecu onongo peya oo i gang meno, ento onongo pud tye kama Marta oromo kwede iye. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Ka Lujudaya ma onongo gitye bote i ot kakweyo cwinye guneno Maliam oa malo aruya me kato woko, ci gulubu kore, pien onongo gutamo ni en obicito iwi lyel kakoko kunu. <verse eid="JHN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Ka Maliam oo kama Yecu tye iye, onene, ci opoto piny katyene, kun wace ni, “Rwot, kono nene onongo ibedo tye kany, kono omera pe oto.” <verse eid="JHN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Yecu onene ka kok, wa ki kit ma Lujudaya bene gukok kwede, ci ocur ki cwercwiny madit. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Ci openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Wukano kome kwene?”</char> Ci gudoke iye ni, “Rwot, bin inen.” <verse eid="JHN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Ci Yecu okok. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Omiyo Lujudaya guwaco ni, “Nen, yam mare mada.” <verse eid="JHN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Ento jo mogo ikin gi guwaco ni, “En ceng oyabo wang lutowang onongo pe twero gengo Lajaro ka to?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocero Lajaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Yecu dok owinyo cwercwiny madit tutwal, ci ocito iwi lyel; lyel meno onongo yam obedo boro got, ma kiloro doge ki got. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Ci Yecu owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Wukwanyu got woko cen.”</char> Ento Marta lamin latoni owaconi, “Rwot, kombedi dong kome ngwe, pien orii ilyel nino angwen kulu.” <verse eid="JHN 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Ento Yecu odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“Nakanen pe awaci ni, ka iye, ci ibineno deyo pa Lubanga?”</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Ci dano gukwanyo got woko. Ci Yecu oilo wange malo, ci owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Aba, apwoyi pien dong i winya.</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" /><char style="wj">An angeyo con ni in i winya kare ducu, ento awaco lok man pi lwak ma gucung kangeta kany, wek guye ni in aye ma iora.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Ka dong owaco lok man, ci odange ki dwon malongo ni, <char style="wj">“Lajaro, kati woko!”</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Ci en ma onongo otoni okati woko, kun onongo kiriyo cinge ki tyene ki bongo yik, dok wange bene onongo pud oboone woko ki bongonu. Ci Yecu owaco ki gin ni, <char style="wj">“Wugonye woko wek owoti.”</char><verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kipiro lok me neko Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mar 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Jo mapol ikin Lujudaya ma gubino kacel ki Maliam, ka guneno gin ma Yecu otiyo, ci guye en. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Ento jo mukene ikin gi gucito bot Luparicayo, ci gutito botgi gin ma Yecu otiyo. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Omiyo ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki Luparicayo gulwongo kacoke pa lutela, ci guwaco ni, “Wabitimo gin ango? Pien dano man tye katiyo lanyut mapol. <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Ka waweke kitmeno, ci dano biye en, ci jo Roma bibino, gibiketo kabedowa maleng wa ki rokwa woko.” <verse eid="JHN 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Ento ngat acel ikin gi, ma nyinge Kayapa, ma en ajwaka madit i mwaka meno, owaco ki gin ni, “Wun pe wungeyo gin mo kadi matidi mo. <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Dok pe wutamo ni bibedo ber botwu ka dano acel oto pi lwak, wek pe kityek rokwa woko ducu?” <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Ento Kayapa pe owaco lok man pire kene, ento pi bedo ajwaka madit i mwaka meno ceng en otito macalo lanebi ni Yecu bito pi rok pa Lujudaya. <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />En pe otito lok nebi pi rok meno keken, ento wek ocok rok mukene ducu ma i lobo ma guket ata, me bedo lutino pa Lubanga, wek oribgi gudok acel. <verse eid="JHN 11:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Ci ocake inino meno ludito pa Lujudaya guribo doggi me neke.<verse eid="JHN 11:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Pimeno Yecu pe dok obedo kawot kamaleng ikin Lujudaya, ento oa ki kunu, ocito i lobo macok ki tim, i taun ma kilwongo Epraim; ci obedo kunu ki lupwonyene.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Ka kare me Karama me Kato pa Lujudaya onongo dong tye cok, ci Lujudaya mapol gua ki ikin lobogi ci gucito i Jerucalem ma peya Karama me Kato oromo, wek gucob cik me lonyegi inyim Lubanga. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Guyenyo Yecu, kun giloko keken gi ma gucung i Ot pa Lubanga ni, “Wutamo ningning? Nyo en pe bibino pi nino madit ba?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki Luparicayo onongo dong guciko dano ni, ka ngat mo ongeyo kama en tye iye, myero onyutigi, wek gimake woko.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s1">Kiwiro Yecu ki moo i Betania</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mar 14:3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Ka odong nino abicel me o i Karama me Kato, ci Yecu obino i Betania, kama Lajaro bedo iye, en ma ceng Yecu ocere ki ikin jo ma otoni. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Gutede cam me otyeno kunu; Marta obedo kapoko cam, dok Lajaro onongo ngat acel ikin jo ma obedo kwede idog cam. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:37">Luk 7:37</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 7:38">38</ref></char></note> Ci Maliam okwanyo moo ma ngwece kur me wel madwong, moo nard magili, maromo lita acel, ci owiro ki tyen Yecu, kun jwayo tyen Yecu ki yer wiye; ci ngwec moo oromo i ot ducu. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Ento Juda me Keriot, ngat acel ikin lupwonyene, en ma bidobe, openyo ni, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Pingo moo man pe kicato i wel me ciling me ryal alip miya adek, wek kimii bot lucan?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />En owaco lok man, pe ni en paro pi lucan, ento pien en yam lakwo, dok onongo lagwok kicaa lim, ci en onongo kwalo lim ma kibolo iye woko. <verse eid="JHN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Ci Yecu owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Wuweke mot, wek en okan pi nino me yika.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Nwo 15:11</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Lucan gitye kwedwu nino ducu, ento an pe abibedo kwedwu nino ducu.”</char><verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiporo lok me neko Lajaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Lwak Lujudaya madwong guniang ni Yecu tye i Betania, ci gubino, pe pi Yecu keken, ento bene pi neno Lajaro ma en ocero ki ikin jo ma otoni. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Pimeno ajwaki madito pa Lubanga guyubu lok me neko Lajaro bene, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />pien pi Lajaro Lujudaya mapol gua woko ki botgi, ci guye Yecu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu odonyo i Jerucalem ki kwogo madit</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mar 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19:28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Orwone lwak jo mapol mayam gubino inino Karama me Kato guwinyo ni Yecu tye kabino i Jerucalem. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25">Jab 118:25</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 118:26">26</ref></char></note> Ci gukwanyo jang otit, gukato kajole, kun gidange ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">“Ojana!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">Lubanga omii gum ikom ngat ma bino inying Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">ma en Rwot pa Icrael!”<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Yecu onongo latin kana ci obedo iwiye; kit macalo kicoyo ni,<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Jek 9:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “Pe wulwor, wun jo me Cion!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">Nen, Rwotwu tye kabino botwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">obedo iwi latin kana.”<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Lupwonyene pe guniang man kong; ento ka dong kiketo deyo ikom Yecu, ci gupo ni ceng kicoyo lok magi ikome, dok ni kitimo tim magi ikome. <verse eid="JHN 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Lwak mayam onongo tye bote ikare ma en lwongo Lajaro ki i lyel me cere ki ikin jo ma oto gutito pire. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />En aye ma omiyo lwak ocito kajole, pien guwinyo ni en otiyo lanyut man. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Luparicayo guloko keken gi ni, “Pe dong wuneno, pe watwero gin mo! Nen, lobo ducu dong owire woko me lube.”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lugrik mogo gumito neno Yecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Ikin jo mayam gucito kaworo Lubanga inino madit me Karama me Kato i Jerucalem onongo jo mogo Lugrik. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Jonu gucito bot Pilipo me Betecaida matye i Galilaya, ci guwace ni, “Ladit, wamito neno Yecu.” <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Pilipo ocito, otito bot Anderiya; Anderiya ocito kacel ki Pilipo, gutito bot Yecu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yecu odok ki gin iye ni, <char style="wj">“Cawa dong oromo wek kimii deyo ikom Wod pa dano.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" /><char style="wj">Adada awaciwu ni, nyig ngano ka pe opoto ingom, oto, bedo kene; ento ka oto, ci ceko nyige mapol.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:25">16:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mar 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Luk 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">17:33</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ngat ma maro kwo ne, birwenyone; ngat ma kwero kwo ne i lobo man, bigwoko nio ikom kwo ma pe tum.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" /><char style="wj">Ka ngat mo mito tic pira, myero oluba; kama an abedo iye, latica bene bibedo kunu; ka ngat mo tiyo pira, ci Won biketo woro ikome.</char><verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu oloko pi tone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />
    <char style="wj">Cwinya kombedi dong obale woko. Abiwaco lok ango? Atwero waco ni, Wora, lara ikom cawa man? Pe kumeno, ento pi lok man omiyo ao ikom cawa man me can.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" /><char style="wj">Wora, ket deyo ikom nyingi.”</char> Ci dwon oa ki i polo ni, “Dong aketo deyo ikome, dok abiketone aye.” <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Ento lwak ma gucung ka ngete guwinyo, ci guwaco ni, “Polo omor.” Dok jo mukene guwaconi, “Lamalaika oloko kwede.” <verse eid="JHN 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Ci Yecu ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“Dwon man pe obino pira, ento pirwu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" /><char style="wj">Kombedi dong cawa me ngolo kop ikom lobo man; kombedi dong kibituru twero pa lalo lobo man woko.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" /><char style="wj">An ka kitinga kun kiila malo ki i lobo, ci abikelo dano ducu bota.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />En oloko lok man pi nyutu kit to ma en bito kwede <verse eid="JHN 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Jab 110:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Ica 9:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:25">Eje 37:25</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:14">Dan 7:14</ref></char></note> Ci lwak gugamo doge ni, “Wan wawinyo ki i cik ni Kricito ma Lubanga oyero bedo nakanaka. In dok iwaco ningning ni, ‘Wod pa dano myero kitinge malo?’ Wod pa dano man en anga?” <verse eid="JHN 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Ci Yecu owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Dero pud tye ikinwu pi kare manok. Wuwot ma kun wutye ki dero, wek piny macol pe ongukwu. Ngat ma woto i piny macol pe ngeyo kama cito iye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" /><char style="wj">Ka pud wutye ki dero, ci wuye dero, wek wudok lutino me dero.”</char></para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 12:36">Lujudaya pe guketo niyegi ikom Yecu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Ka Yecu oloko lok man, ci opoke ki botgi, okane woko ki botgi. <verse eid="JHN 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Kadi bed otiyo lanyut marom meno inyimgi, pe guketo niyegi ikom en. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Ica 53:1</ref></char></note> Man otime wek lok pa lanebi Icaya ocobe kakare, ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">“Rwot, anga ma oye lok ma watito?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">Dok anga ma Rwot onyutu tekone bote?”<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Man en gin ma omiyo pe gitwero ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:39">pien Icaya dok owaco ni,<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:40: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 6:10">Ica 6:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “Lubanga oneko wanggi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">dok odingo wigi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">wek pe gunen ki wanggi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">pe bene guniang,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">wek gin pe guloke gudwog bota wek acanggi.”<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Icaya owaco lok man pien oneno deyo mere, ci oloko pire. <verse eid="JHN 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Kadi bed kitmeno, jo mapol ma ikin luloc bene guye en, ento pi lworo Luparicayo omiyo pe gutucu, wek pe kiryemgi woko ki i kacoke. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Gin onongo gimaro deyo ma dano keto ikomgi makato ma Lubanga miyo.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngolo kop ma a ki i lok pa Yecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Yecu oloko ki dwon malongo kun waco ni, <char style="wj">“Ngat ma ye an, nongo pe oye an keken, ento nongo bene oye ngat ma oora.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" /><char style="wj">Ngat ma onena, nongo oneno ngat ma oora.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" /><char style="wj">An abino i lobo pi bedo dero me lobo, wek dano ducu ma ye an owek bedo i piny macol.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" /><char style="wj">Ka dano mo winyo loka ce pe mako me lubune, an pe angolo kop ikome; pien pe abino kangolo kop ikom lobo, ento abino kalaro lobo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" /><char style="wj">Ngat ma kwera, ma pe winyo loka, tye ki ngat ma bingolo kop ikome; lok ma aloko bingolo kop ikome inino me agiki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" /><char style="wj">Pien pe aloko pira kena: Won ma oora, en kikome aye omiya cik, i gin ma myero awac ki ma myero alok.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" /><char style="wj">Angeyo ni cike en kwo ma pe tum; pimeno gin ma awaco, awaco kit macalo Won oloko bota.”</char><verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu olwoko tyen lupwonyene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Ma peya nino madit me Karama me Kato oo, Yecu onongo ngeyo ni cawane dong oromo me weko lobo man me dok bot Won. En yam onongo omaro jone matye i lobo man; dok omarogi nio i agiki. <verse eid="JHN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Yecu ki lupwonyene onongo pud gitye kacamo cam me otyeno. Catan onongo dong oketo tam i cwiny Juda wod pa Cimon me Keriot me dobe. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yecu onongo ngeyo ni Won otyeko miyo jami ducu i cinge, dok ni ea ki bot Lubanga, dok bene ebidok bot Lubanga. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Ci oa malo ki i dog cam, olunyu kanyine oketo tenge, ci okwanyo taulo, otweyo i pyere. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Oonyo pii i becen, ci ocako lwoko tyen lupwonyene, ka yaka dunyu ki taulo ma otweyo i pyere.<verse eid="JHN 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Ka en oo bot Cimon Petero, ci Petero openye ni, “Rwot, in kulu aye ibilwoko tyena?” <verse eid="JHN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Ento Yecu odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“In pe ingeyo gin ma an atye katiyo, ento ibiniang lacen.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Ci dok Petero owace ni, “In pe ibilwoko tyena matwal.” Ento Yecu odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“Ka pe alwoko tyeni, ci nongo pe inywako kacel kweda.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Cimon Petero owace ni, “Rwot, pe dong ilwok tyena keken, ento cinga ki wiya bene!” <verse eid="JHN 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Ci Yecu owace ni, <char style="wj">“Ngat madong olwoke, pe dong myero olwok kome, ento kono tyene keken, pien nongo kome ducu leng. Wun ducu komwu dong leng nikwanyo ngat acel keken.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />En onongo ongeyo ngat ma obidobe; en aye gin ma omiyo en owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Wun ducu pe komwu leng.”</char><verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:27">Luk 22:27</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ka dong otyeko lwoko tyen gi, ci okwanyo kanyine, ci odok i kabedone, ka yaka openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Wuniang gin ma atimo ikomwu?</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" /><char style="wj">Wulwonga ni Lapwony dok ni Rwot; meno tye atir, pien meno aye an kikome.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" /><char style="wj">Ka an ma Rwotwu ki Lapwonywu, alwoko tyenwu, wun bene myero wulwok tyenwu kekenwu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" /><char style="wj">An dong anyutiwu lanen, wek wun bene wutim gin ma an atimo ikomwu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Mat 10:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:40">Luk 6:40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">Jon 15:20</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Adada awaciwu ni, latic pe bedo dit makato ladite, ngat ma kioro pe dit kato ngat ma oore.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" /><char style="wj">Ka wungeyo lok man, ci wubibedo ki yomcwiny ka wutiyogi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Jab 41:9</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Pe aloko man ikom wun ducu. An angeyo jo madong atyeko yerogi. Ento wek ginacoya ocobe kakare, ni, ‘Ngat ma camo cam kacel kweda oloko tere ikoma.’</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" /><char style="wj">Kombedi atitiwu lok man ma peya otime, wek ka bitime, wuye ni an a en.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mat 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mar 9:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Luk 9:48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">10:16</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Adada awaciwu ni, ngat ma jolo dano ma an aoro, nongo ojolo an; ngat ma jolo an, nongo ojolo ngat ma oora.”</char><verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu otito ni kibidobe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Mat 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Mar 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luk 22:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />I ngeye ma Yecu oloko lok man, cwinye onongo dong obale woko. Ci oloko atyer kamaleng ni, <char style="wj">“Adada awaciwu ni, ngat acel ikinwu obidoba.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Ci Lupwonye gunene keken gi, ento pe guniang ngat ma en oloko ikomeni. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Ngat acel ikin lupwonye, en ma Yecu maro, onongo obedo cok i kanget Yecu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Ci Cimon Petero ogwele, ci openye ni, “Tuciwa ngat ma en oloko ikome.” <verse eid="JHN 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Ci lapwonye meno olyane macok ite it Yecu ci openye ni, “Anga, Rwot?” <verse eid="JHN 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Ci Yecu ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“Ka alutu mugati i dek, ci ngat ma abimiyo boteni en aye en.”</char> Ka dong olutu mugati i dek, ci omiyo bot Juda wod pa Cimon me Keriot. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Cut ma Juda ogamo, ci Catan otugi donyo i iye. Ci Yecu owace ni, <char style="wj">“Tim gin ma i mito timoni oyoto.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Pe tye ngat mo i dog cam ma oniang gin ma omiyo Yecu oloko lok man bot Juda. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Ento Juda onongo obedo lagwok kicaa limgi, omiyo jo mogo gutamo ni, Yecu owace ni ocit owil jami mamite pi nino me kwero karama madit, nyo ni myero omii gin mo bot lucan. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Ka Juda otyeko camo mugati ma kimiyeni, ci okato woko cut. Piny onongo dong col.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cik manyen ma Yecu omiyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Ikare ma Juda dong okato woko, ci Yecu owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Kombedi dong deyo ma kiketo ikom Wod pa dano binen kamaleng, dok deyo pa Lubanga binen ikome.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" /><char style="wj">Ka kiketo deyo ikom Lubanga pire, ci Lubanga bene biketo deyo ikom Wod pa Dano, en biketo deyo ikome cut.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:34">Jon 7:34</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Lutino adunu, pud atye kwedwu pi kare manok. Wubiyenya, ento macalo ceng atito bot Lujudaya, kitmeno atitiwu bene kombedi ni, ‘Kama acito iye, wun pe wutwero bino iye.’</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:12">Jon 15:12</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 15:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:23">1 Jon 3:23</ref>; <ref loc="2JN 1:5">2 Jon 5</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Amiyowu cik manyen, ni, wumare kekenwu; wumare kekenwu kit macalo an amarowu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" /><char style="wj">Piman dano ducu bingeyo ni wun lupwonyena, ka wumare ikinwu.”</char><verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu otito ni Petero bikwere</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mar 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Cimon Petero openye ni, “Rwot, in ibicito kwene?” Ci Yecu ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“Kama acito iye, pe itwero luba kombedi, ento ibiluba lacen.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Petero dok openye ni, “Rwot, pingo pe atwero lubi kombedi? Abimiyo kwona piri.” <verse eid="JHN 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Ci Yecu ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“Ibimiyo kwoni pira? Adada awaci ni, twon gweno pe bikok, nio ka kong ikwera tyen adek.”</char><verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu en yo me o bot Lubanga Won</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />
    <char style="wj">“Pe wuwek cwinywu obed ki par mapol; wuye Lubanga, dok wuye an bene.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" /><char style="wj">I ot pa Wora tye iye kabedo mapol. Ka onongo pe kitmeno, kono onongo pe atitiwu ni acito kayubu ki wun kabedo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" /><char style="wj">Ka acito, ayubu ki wun kabedo, ci dok abidwogo kaomowu, wek kama an abedo iye, wun bene wubed iye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" /><char style="wj">Kama an acito iye, wun wungeyo yone.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Ci Tomaci owace ni, “Rwot, wan pe wangeyo kama icito iye; watwero ngeyo yone ningning?” <verse eid="JHN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yecu odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“An a yoo, ki ada, ki kwo; pe tye ngat mo ma bino bot Won, kono ki i an keken.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" /><char style="wj">Kono ceng wungeya, kono wungeyo Wora bene; nicake kombedi dong wungeye, dok bene dong wunene.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Ci Pilipo ogamo doge ni, “Rwot, nyutiwa Won, ci biromowa.” <verse eid="JHN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yecu odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“Dong arii kwedwu kare malac rom man, ento pud peya ingeya, Pilipo? Ngat ma oneno an nongo dong oneno Won; itwero waco ningning ni, ‘Nyutiwa Won?’</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" /><char style="wj">In pe iye ni an atye i Won, ki Won i an? Lok ma aloko botwu pe aloko pira kena, ento Won ma bedo i an aye tiyo tice.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" /><char style="wj">Wuye ni an atye i Won, ki Won i an; nyo ka pe kitmeno, wuye an pi tic ma atiyo keken.</char><verse eid="JHN 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />
    <char style="wj">Adada awaciwu ni, ngat ma ye an, en bene bitiyo tic ma an atiyo; dok bitiyo tic madito makato man, pien acito bot Won.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" /><char style="wj">Gin ducu ma wubilego i nyinga, abitiyone, wek kiket deyo ikom Won pi Wod.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" /><char style="wj">Ka wubilego gin mo i nyinga, ci abitiyone.</char><verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocike ni ebicwalo Cwiny Maleng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />
    <char style="wj">Ka wumara, ci wubigwoko cika.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" /><char style="wj">Ci abilego Won, wek en omii ki wun Lacungudwar mukene ma bibedo kwedwu nakanaka,</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" /><char style="wj">en Cwiny me ada, ma lobo pe twero limo, pien lobo pe nene, dok pe ngeye. Wun wungeye, pien en bedo kwedwu, dok bibedo i wun.</char><verse eid="JHN 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />
    <char style="wj">Pe abiwekowu macalo lutino kic; abidwogo botwu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" /><char style="wj">Odong kare manok, ci lobo pe dok binena, ento wun wubinena; pien an akwo, wun bene wubikwo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" /><char style="wj">Inino meno wubingeyo ni an atye i Won, ki wun i an, ki an i wun.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" /><char style="wj">Ngat matye ki cika, ma gwokogi, en aye ngat ma mara; ngat ma mara, Wora bimare, an bene abimare, abinyute bote.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Juda ma pe me Keriot openyeni, “Rwot, man bibedo ningning, ni ibinyute botwa, ento pe bot lobo?” <verse eid="JHN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Ci Yecu odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“Ka ngat mo mara, ci en bimako lok mera. Wora bimare, ci An kacel ki Wora wabibino bote, ci wabibedo kacel kwede.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" /><char style="wj">Ento ngat ma pe mara, pe lubu loka. Lok ma wuwinyoni pe mera, ento pa Won ma ceng oora.</char><verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />
    <char style="wj">Lok man atitiwu kun pud atye botwu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" /><char style="wj">Ento Lacungudwar, ma en Cwiny Maleng, ma Won bicwalo i nyinga, en bipwonyowu jami ducu, en bipoyo wiwu i lok ducu mayam atitiwu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" /><char style="wj">Awekiwu kuc, kuc mera amiyo botwu. Amiyowu, pe kit macalo lobo miyo. Pe wuwek cwinywu obed ki par mo, pe wulwor.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" /><char style="wj">Dong wuwinyo awaciwu ni, an abicito woko, dok abidwogo botwu. Kono wumara, kono cwinywu yom, pien acito bot Won; pien Won dit kata.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" /><char style="wj">Kombedi atito ki wun lok man ma peya otime, wek ka bitime, ci wuye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" /><char style="wj">Pe dok abiduru lwak lok mapol kwedwu, pien laloc me lobo man tye kabino. En pe tye ki twer ikoma;</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" /><char style="wj">ento man time wek lobo onge ni, an amaro Won, dok atiyo macalo Won ocika.</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">
    <char style="wj">Ayu malo, wacitu.”</char><verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu en olok me ada</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />
    <char style="wj">“An aye olok me ada, Wora en aye lapur.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" /><char style="wj">En lwero janga ducu ma ikoma ma pe nyak woko, ento janga ducu ma nyak en yubu, wek omede, onyak mapol.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" /><char style="wj">Wun dong kityeko yubuwu woko pi lok ma apwonyowu kwede.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" /><char style="wj">Wubed i an, ki an bene i wun. Macalo jang olok pe twero nyak pire kene, ka pe tye ikom yat olok, kitmeno wun bene pe wutwero nyak, ka pe wubedo i an.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" /><char style="wj">An olok, wun jange. Ngat ma bedo i an, ki an i en, en nyako nyige mapol, pien pe wutwero timo gin mo labongo an.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" /><char style="wj">Ka dano mo pe bedo i an, ci kibole woko macalo jang yat ma kitongo, ci two woko. Kicokogi, kibologi i mac, ci giwang woko.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" /><char style="wj">Ka wubedo i an, kun loka bedo i wun, ci wuleg gin ducu ma wumito, ci kibitimo pirwu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" /><char style="wj">Man bikelo deyo ikom Wora, ka wunyako nyigwu mapol; kitmeno wubidoko lupwonyena.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" /><char style="wj">Macalo Won ceng omara, an bene amarowu kitmeno; wubed i mara.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" /><char style="wj">Ka wugwoko cika, ci wubibedo i mara, kit macalo ceng agwoko cik pa Wora, ci abedo i mare.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" /><char style="wj">Lok man atitiwu wek yomcwinya obed i wun, wek wupong ki yomcwiny.</char><verse eid="JHN 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 13:34">Jon 13:34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:17">15:17</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:23">1 Jon 3:23</ref>; <ref loc="2JN 1:5">2 Jon 5</ref></char>
    </note> <char style="wj">Man aye cika, ni wumare kekenwu kit macalo ceng amarowu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" /><char style="wj">Pe tye ngat mo matye ki mar madit makato man, ni dano mo miyo kwone pi lureme.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" /><char style="wj">Wun lurema ka wutiyo gin ducu ma acikowu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" /><char style="wj">Pe dok alwongowu ni lutic, pien latic pe ngeyo gin ma ladite tiyo; ento alwongowu ni lurema, pien gin ducu mayam awinyo ki bot Wora dong atyeko nyutiwu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" /><char style="wj">Pe wun aye wuyera, ento an aye ayerowu, dok aketowu wek wucit wunyak nyigwu, dok wek nyigwu orii; wek gin ducu ma wubilego ki bot Won i nyinga, en omii ki wun.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" /><char style="wj">Gin ma acikowu en ene ni, wumare kekenwu.</char><verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adagadaga pa Lobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />
    <char style="wj">Ka lobo okwerowu, ci wun myero wunge ni yam okwongo kwero an ma kun peya okwerowu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" /><char style="wj">Kono onongo wun wubedo jo me lobo, kono lobo omaro wun; ento wun pe jo me lobo, ento ayerowu ki i lobo; pimeno lobo okwerowu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Mat 10:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:40">Luk 6:40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Jon 13:16</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Wupo i lok mayam atito botwu ni, ‘Latic pe bedo dit makato ladite.’ Ka yam kiliba, wun bene kibilibowu; ka yam gumako loka, ci gin bimako mewu bene.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" /><char style="wj">Gin magi ducu kibitimo ikomwu pi nyinga, pien pe gingeyo ngat mayam oora.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" /><char style="wj">Kono pe nene abino, aloko botgi, kono pe gitye ki bal; ento kombedi dong pe gitye ki lok ma gibipido kwede pi balgi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" /><char style="wj">Ngat ma kwera, nongo okwero Wora bene.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" /><char style="wj">Kono yam pe atiyo ikin gi tic ma dano mo mukene pe otiyo, kono pe gitye ki bal, ento kombedi dong guneno dok gukwero an kacel ki Wora.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 35:19">Jab 35:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:4">69:4</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ento man otime wek lok ma kicoyo i Cik meggi ocobe kakare ni, ‘Kikwera nonono.’</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" /><char style="wj">Ento ka Lacungudwar bibino, ma abioro botwu nia ki bot Won, ma en aye Cwiny me ada ma a ki bot Won, en bibedo cadena.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" /><char style="wj">Wun bene wucaden, pien wubedo bota nia i acaki.</char><verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />
    <char style="wj">Atyeko titiwu lok man wek pe cwinywu oari ki i niyewu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" /><char style="wj">Kibiryemowu woko ki i kacoke; dok kare bibino ma dano ducu ma nekowu bitamo ni gitye katic pi Lubanga.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" /><char style="wj">Kibitimo man ikomwu pien pe gingeyo Won, kadi an bene.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" /><char style="wj">Ento atitiwu lok magi wek ka karegi bio, wupo ni yam atitiwu pirgi.</char></para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 16:4">Tic pa Cwiny Maleng</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">
    <char style="wj">Yam pe atito lok man botwu i acaki, pien onongo pud atye kwedwu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" /><char style="wj">Ento dong abidok bot ngat ma ceng oora, pe tye ngat mo ikinwu ma penya ni. ‘Icito kwene?’</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" /><char style="wj">Cwinywu opong ki kumu pien atitiwu lok man.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" /><char style="wj">Ento atye katitiwu lok ada ni, bibedo ber botwu ka an acito; pien ka pe acito, ci Lacungudwar pe bibino botwu. Ento ka acito, ci abiore botwu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" /><char style="wj">En ka obino, bimiyo lobo niang ikom bal, ki kit ma atir, ki ngolo kop:</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" /><char style="wj">ikom bal, pien pe giye an;</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" /><char style="wj">ikom kit ma atir, pien adok bot Won, pe dok wubinena;</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" /><char style="wj">ikom ngolo kop, pien laloc me lobo man dong kingole kop woko.</char><verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />
    <char style="wj">Pud atye ki lok mapol me awaca botwu, ento pe wutwero kanyone.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" /><char style="wj">Ka Cwiny me ada bibino, en bitelowu i ada ducu; pien en pe bilok pire kene, ento gin ducu ma en biwinyo, biwaco botwu, dok bititiwu gin ma bitime anyim.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" /><char style="wj">En biketo deyo ikoma, pien bikwanyo loka, ci biwaciwu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" /><char style="wj">Gin ducu ma Won tye kwede mega; en ma omiyo awaciwu ni, Cwiny Maleng bikwanyo loka, ci biwaciwu.</char><verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cwercwiny ki Yomcwiny</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />
    <char style="wj">Odong kare manok, ci pe dok wubinena; ento inge kare manok, ci wubinena.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Ci Lupwonyene mogo guloko keken gi ni, “Man gin ango ma en waco botwa, ni, ‘odong kare manok, ci pe wubinena, ento inge kare manok, ci wubinena’; dok ni, ‘Pien adok bot Won’?” <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Ci Lupwonyene guwaco ni, “Man kono te loke ningo, ni, ‘odong kare manok’? Pe waniang gin ma en tye kawaco.” <verse eid="JHN 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Ento Yecu ongeyo ni gin mito penye, omiyo en owacigi ni, <char style="wj">“Wutye kapenye kekenwu pi lok manen awaciwu ni, ‘Odong kare manok, ci pe dok wubinena; ento inge kare manok, ci wubinena’?</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" /><char style="wj">Adada awaciwu ni, wubikok, wubikumu, ento lobo cwinye bibedo yom; cwinywu bicwer, ento cwercwinywu biloke doko yomcwiny.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" /><char style="wj">Ka mwoc ogoyo dako, ci en bedo ki arem, pien cawane nongo dong oromo me nywal; ento ka dong onywal, ci pe po pi arem pien nongo cwinye yom pi nywalo dano i lobo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" /><char style="wj">Kombedi cwinywu cwer, ento abinenowu doki, ci cwinywu bibedo yom, pe tye ngat mo ma bikwanyo yomcwinywu ki botwu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" /><char style="wj">Inino meno pe wubipenya lok mo. Adada awaciwu ni, ka wubilego gin mo bot Won, en bimiyowu i nyinga.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" /><char style="wj">Nio icawa man peya wulego gin mo i nyinga; wulegi, ci wubinongo, wek wupong ki yomcwiny.</char><verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Loc ikom lobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />
    <char style="wj">Lok man atitiwu i carolok; ento kare bibino ma pe dok abilok kwedwu i carolok, ento abititiwu lok ikom Won kamaleng.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" /><char style="wj">Inino meno wubilego Won i nyinga. Pe awaciwu ni abilego Won me kakawu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" /><char style="wj">Won kikome marowu, pien wun wumara, dok wuye ni an aa ki bot Won.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" /><char style="wj">An aa ki bot Won, ka abino i lobo; dok abiweko lobo, me dok bot Won.”</char><verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Ci Lupwonyene guwaco ni, “Nen, dong itye kalok kamaleng, pe i carolok. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Kombedi dong wangeyo ni, in ingeyo gin ducu, dok pe dong wamito penyi; piman waye ni in ia ki bot Lubanga.” <verse eid="JHN 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yecu odok iye ki gin ni, <char style="wj">“Kombedi dong wuye?</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" /><char style="wj">Kare bibino, dok bene dong oo, ma wubiket woko, ngat acel acel i pacone, wubiweka kena. Ento pe atye kena, pien Won tye kweda.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" /><char style="wj">Awaco lok man botwu wek wubed ki kuc i an. I lobo wutye ki can; ento wudii cwinywu, an dong aloyo lobo.”</char><verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu olego pi lupwonyene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Ka Yecu oloko man, ci oilo wange malo i polo, ci owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Wora, kare dong oromo; ket deyo ikom Wodi, wek Wodi bene oket deyo ikomi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" /><char style="wj">Macalo yam imiye twero ikom gin ducu matye ki kom, wek omii kwo ma pe tum bot jo ducu ma ceng imiyo bote.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" /><char style="wj">Man en kwo ma pe tum, ni gunge in Lubanga acel me ada, ki Yecu Kricito mayam ioro.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" /><char style="wj">Dong aketo deyo ikomi i lobo, kun acobo tic ma ceng imiya me atiya.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" /><char style="wj">Wora, kombedi dong i ket deyo ikoma inyimi, ki deyo mayam abedo kwede inyimi ma peya icweyo lobo.</char><verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />
    <char style="wj">An atyeko nyutu nyingi bot jo ma ceng imiya ki i lobo. Gin ceng meri, dok in imiyogi bota, gin gugwoko loki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" /><char style="wj">Dok bene dong gingeyo ni jami ducu ma imiya oa ki boti.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" /><char style="wj">An dong amiyo botgi lok ma ceng imiya, ci gin dong gujolo, dok gingeyo atikatika ni an aa ki boti; dok giye ni in iora.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" /><char style="wj">Alego pirgi; pe alego pi lobo, ento pi jo ma ceng imiya, pien gin meri.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" /><char style="wj">Jona ducu obedo meri, ki meri ducu obedo mera, alimo deyo pirgi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" /><char style="wj">An pe dok abedo i lobo, ento gin gitye i lobo, an abibino boti. Won Maleng, gwokgi i nyingi ma con imiya, wek gubed acel kit macalo wan acel.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Jab 41:9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:18">Jon 13:18</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ka ceng atye kwedgi kacel, agwokogi i nyingi ma imiya; agwokogi, pe tye mo ma orwenyo ki ikin gi, kono dano ma myero orweny keken, wek ginacoya ocobe kakare.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" /><char style="wj">Ento kombedi atye kabino boti; lok man aloko i lobo, wek gubed ki yomcwiny ma mera, wek gupong kwede.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" /><char style="wj">Atyeko miyogi lok meri; ci lobo okwerogi, pien gin pe jo me lobo, macalo an bene pe a dano me lobo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" /><char style="wj">Pe alego ni myero ikwanygi woko ki i lobo, ento ni igwokgi ki ikom Larac.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" /><char style="wj">Gin pe jo me lobo, macalo ceng an bene pe a dano me lobo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" /><char style="wj">Lonygi ki ada; loki en ada.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" /><char style="wj">Macalo iora i lobo, an bene aorogi i lobo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" /><char style="wj">An amiyo kwona kena pirgi, wek gin bene gumii kwogi ken gi piri.</char><verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />
    <char style="wj">Pe alego pi jo man keken, ento pi jo ma biye an pi lokgi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" /><char style="wj">Wek gin ducu gubed acel. Kitmacalo in, Wora, ibedo i an, an bene i in, gin ducu gubed i wan, wek lobo oye ni in iora.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" /><char style="wj">Deyo ma ceng imiya, an amiyo botgi, wek gubed acel macalo wan acel,</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" /><char style="wj">an i gin ki in i an, gubed acel atika, wek lobo onge ni in iora, dok imarogi macalo imara.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" /><char style="wj">Wora, amitoni joni ma imiya ni, gubed bota kama an atye iye, wek gunen deyo mera ma imiya pi mar meri ma imara kwede ma ocake ma peya icibo guti me lobo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" /><char style="wj">Ai Won ma opore, lobo con pe ongeyi, ento an angeyi; ki jo man ngeyo ni in iora.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" /><char style="wj">Amiyo nyingi ongene botgi, dok abimiyo ngene, wek mar ma imara kwede obed i gin, ki an i igi.”</char><verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s1">Kimako Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mar 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-50">Luk 22:47-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Ka Yecu otyeko loko lok man, ci oa kacel ki lupwonyene, ci gucito gungolo nota me Kidron. Onongo tye poto mo kunu, ci odonyo iye kacel ki lupwonyene. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Juda, ma ceng odobe, bene onongo ngeyo kabedo meno, pien Yecu ki lupwonyene yam gimaro coke kunu. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Juda ogamo lwak acikari ki ludito tic mogo ki bot ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki Luparicayo, ci gucito kunu ki tara ki mac raa ki jami lweny. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Yecu onongo ngeyo gin ducu ma bitime ikome, ci okato botgi, kun penyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Wuyenyo anga?”</char> <verse eid="JHN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Ci gin gudoke iye ni, “Yecu me Najaret.” Ci Yecu ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“An a en.”</char> Juda ma odobe onongo ocung kacel kwedgi. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Ka Yecu owaco ki gin ni, <char style="wj">“An a en,”</char> gujer ki ngegi, gupoto piny. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Ci dok openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Wuyenyo anga?”</char> Ci gin gudoke iye ni, “Yecu me Najaret.” <verse eid="JHN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Ci Yecu owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Atyeko titiwu ni an a en; ka wuyenya, ci wuwek jo man guciti.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Man otime wek lok ma ceng en oloko ocobe kakare, ni, <char style="wj">“Ikin jo ma ceng imiya, pe tye mo ma orwenyo.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Cimon Petero onongo tye ki pala lucwan; ci owoto, otongo ki opii pa ajwaka madit, ci onguno ite ma lacuc woko. Nying opii meno Maliko. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Ci Yecu ociko Petero ni, <char style="wj">“Dwok palani i akurane. Itamoni pe abimato ki ikikopo me can ma Wora omiyani?”</char><verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kitero Yecu inyim Anac</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Lwak acikari ki laditgi ki lutic pa Lujudaya gumako Yecu, ci gutweye. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Ci gukwongo tere bot Anac, ma Kayapa onyomo nyare, ma onongo en ajwaka madit i mwaka meno. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:49">Jon 11:49</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 11:50">50</ref></char></note> Kayapa en aye ceng omiyo tam bot Lujudaya ni ber dano acel oto pi lwak.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petero okwero Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Mat 26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Mar 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luk 22:55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Cimon Petero olubu kor Yecu, kacel ki lapwonye acel mukene. Lapwonye man onongo ngeyo ajwaka madit, omiyo en odonyo idyekal pa ajwaka madit kacel ki Yecu; <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />ento Petero ocung woko i dogcel. Lapwonye meno ma ajwaka madit ngeyoni ocito, ci oloko ki angeca ma gwoko dogcel, ci okelo Petero i idyekal. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Ci angeca ma gwoko dogcel openyo Petero ni, “In bene pe itye ikin lupwonye pa dano man?” Ento Petero ogamo ni, “An a peke ikin gi.” <verse eid="JHN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Lutic ki ludito tic onongo gumoko mac miri iwang oo, pien piny onongo ngic, ci gucung kun gioyo mac. Petero bene onongo ocung kacel kwedgi ka oyo mac.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ajwaka madit openyo Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mar 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luk 22:66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Ajwaka madit openyo Yecu pi lupwonyene, ki ikom lok ma en pwonyo. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Ci Yecu odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“Yam aloko kamaleng bot lwak; nino ducu abedo ka pwony i kacoke ki i Ot pa Lubanga, kama Lujudaya ducu gicoke iye. Pe aloko lok mo i mung.</char> <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" /><char style="wj">Ipenya pingo? Peny jo mayam guwinyo lok ma awaco botgi; gin ngeyo lok ma awaco.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Ka oloko lok man, ci ngat acel ikin ludito tic ma ocung odongo lem Yecu, kun waco ni, “Igamo dog ajwaka madit kumeno?” <verse eid="JHN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Ci Yecu ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“Ka aloko marac, ci nyut caden me gin marac ma an aloko; ento ka aloko maber, ci idonga pingo?”</char> <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Lacen Anac ocwale bot Kayapa, ajwaka madit, kun pud kitweye.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petero dok okwero Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Mat 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Mar 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luk 22:58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Cimon Petero onongo ocung kun oyo mac. Ci jo mukene dok gupenye ni, “In bene pe i ngat acel ikin lupwonyene?” Ento en okwero woko, kun waco ni, “An ko.” <verse eid="JHN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Ngat acel ikin opii pa ajwaka madit, wat pa dano ma Petero onguno iteni, dok openye ni, “Nakanen pe aneni kacel kwede i poto?” <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Ci Petero dok okwero; ci twon gweno otugi kok cut.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu inyim Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11-14">11—14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mar 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Lacen Luyudaya gukwanyo Yecu ki i ot pa Kayapa, gutere i ot pa laloc madit pa Luroma. Onongo piny dong cok ruu. Gin ki komgi pe gudonyo i ot pa laloc madit pa Luroma, pien gumito bedo ma gulonye ite cikgi ni o ka gucamo Karama me Kato. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Piman omiyo Pilato okato woko botgi, ci openyogi ni, “Wudoto dano man pi kop ango?” <verse eid="JHN 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Ci gin gudoke iye ni, “Ka onongo dano man pe latim marac, kono pe wakele boti.” <verse eid="JHN 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Ci Pilato owacigi ni, “Wun ki komwu wutere, wungole kop kun wulubu cikwu.” Ento Lujudaya gudoke iye ni, “Cik pe ye ni wan wanek dano mo.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:14">Jon 3:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:32">12:32</ref></char></note> Man otime wek lok ma Yecu owaco ocobe kakare, kun nyutu kit to ma ebito kwede.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Ci Pilato dok odonyo i ot ci olwongo Yecu, kun penye ni, “In i Rwot pa Lujudaya?” <verse eid="JHN 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Ci Yecu ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“In iwaco lok man piri keni, kece mono jo mukene aye gutiti?”</char> <verse eid="JHN 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Ci Pilato odok iye ni, “An Lajudaya bo? Roki ki ajwaki madito pa Lubanga aye gukeli bota. In itimo gin ango?” <verse eid="JHN 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Ci Yecu ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“Kera pe me lobo man. Ka onongo kera obedo me lobo man, kono jona gulwenyo pira, wek pe kimiya i cing Lujudaya; ento kera pe me lobo man.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Dok Pilato openye ni, “In dong i Rwot bo?” Ci Yecu ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“In iwaco ni An a Rwot. Kinywala piman, abino i lobo bene piman, pi bedo caden me lok ada. Dano ducu ma gitye i ada giwinyo dwona.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Ci Pilato openye ni. “Ada en gin ango?”</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 18:38">Kingolo ki Yecu kop me to</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Mat 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Mar 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23:13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Ka owaco lok man, ci okato woko bot Lujudaya, ci otitigi ni, “An gira pe anongo kop mo ikome. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Ento wun wutye ki kitwu ni myero agonyiwu ngat acel ikare me Karama me Kato. Wumito ni agonyiwu Rwot pa Lujudaya?” <verse eid="JHN 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Ento gin dok guwoo ni, “Pe en, ento Baraba.” Baraba kono ceng lalweny aligo.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Ci Pilato otero Yecu, ka ogoye ki anino. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Acikari gucweyo lalukana okutu, gurwako iwiye, dok guruke ki bongo makwar. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Ci gubino bote kun giwaco ni, “Wamoti ba, Rwot pa Lujudaya!” Ci gudonge.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Pilato dok okato woko botgi, ci owaco ki gin ni, “Nen, akelo en botwu, wek wunge ni pe anongo kop mo ikome.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Ci Yecu okati woko botgi kun oruku lalukana okutu ki bongo makwar. Ka dok Pilato owacigi ni, “Nenu dano man.” <verse eid="JHN 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Ka ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki ludito tic gunene, ci guwoo ni. “Gure ikom yat! Gure ikom yat!” Ento Pilato owaco botgi ni, “Wun wutere, wugure ikom yat, pien an gira pe anongo kop mo ikome.” <verse eid="JHN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Ci Lujudaya gugamo doge ni, “Wan watye ki cik; pi cik meno en myero oto, pien okete kene ni en e Wod pa Lubanga.” <verse eid="JHN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Ka Pilato owinyo lok man, ci lworo omede ikome. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Dok odok iot, openyo Yecu ni, “In ia ki kwene?” Ento Yecu pe ogamo doge. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Omiyo Pilato owace ni, “Pe igamo doga? Pe ingeyo ni atye ki twer me gonyi, ki twer me guri ikom yatariya?” <verse eid="JHN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Ento Yecu odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“Ka onongo nene pe kimiyi twer ma oa ki malo kono pe ibedo ki twer ikoma; pimeno ngat ma omiya boti tye ki bal madit makato.”</char><verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Nia ikare meno Pilato ocako yenyo yo me gonye, ento Lujudaya guwoo ni, “Ka igonyo dano man, ci in pe larem Cecar. Dano ducu ma kete kene me bedo Rwot, nongo pyem ki Cecar.”<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Ka Pilato owinyo lok man, ci okelo Yecu woko, obedo iwi kom me ngolo kop ikabedo ma kicano iye got; ileb Ibru kilwongo ni Gabata. <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Nino meno onongo obedo me Yube me Karama me Kato, ikin cawa macok romo abicel. Ci Pilato owaco bot Lujudaya ni, “Nenu, Rwotwu en!” <verse eid="JHN 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Dano guwoo ni, “Tere woko cen! Tere woko cen! Gure ikom yatariya!” Dok Pilato openyogi ni, “Agur Rwotwu ikom yatariya?” Ci ajwaki madito pa Lubanga gudok iye ni, “Wan pe watye ki Rwot, kono Cecar keken.” <verse eid="JHN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Ci Pilato omiye botgi wek gugure ikom yatariya.<verse eid="JHN 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiguro Yecu ikom yatariya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-34">Mat 27:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mar 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23:26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Ci gutero Yecu woko kun otingo yatariyane, naka wa ikabedo ma kilwongo Cogo Wic; ileb Ibru kilwongo ni, Golgota. <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Ci gugure ikom yatariya kunu, ki jo mukene aryo kacel kwede, acel tungcel, acel tungcel, kun Yecu tye idyere. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Pilato ocoyo lok, ci oguru iwi yatariya ma kicoyo ni, “Yecu me Najaret, Rwot pa Lujudaya.” <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Lujudaya mapol gukwano lok man, pien kama kiguro iye Yecu onongo tye cok ki taun madit, dok kicoyo ileb Ibru, ileb Roma ki ileb Grik. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Ajwaki madito pa Lubanga gucito bot Pilato ci guwaceni, “Pe ico ni, ‘Rwot pa Lujudaya,’ ento ni, ‘Dano man owaco ni, an Rwot pa Lujudaya.’” <verse eid="JHN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Ento Pilato odok iye ni, “Gin ma acoyo, dong acoyo otum.”<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Ka acikari gutyeko guru Yecu ikom yatariya, ci gukwanyo ginarukane, gupoko i dul angwen, dul acel pi acikari acel acel; ki kanyine bene. Kanyine onongo pe kikwoyo akwoya, ento kicweyo acweya, cake ki malo. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Jab 22:18</ref></char></note> Guloko keken gi ni, “Pe myero wayecu, ento wabol kwir iye, wek wanen ngat ma bitero.” Man otime wek ginacoya ocobe kakare, ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">“Gupoko ginarukana ikin gi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">kibolo kwir ikom bongona.”<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Acikari gutimo man; ento min Yecu ki lamin mine, Maliam dako pa Kelopa, ki Maliam Lamagdala onongo gucung cok ki yatariyane. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Ka Yecu oneno mine, ki lapwonye meno ma en maro kun gucung, owaco bot mine ni, <char style="wj">“Maa, nen wodi!”</char> <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Ka dok owaco bot lapwonye meno ni, <char style="wj">“Nen meni.”</char> Nia icawa meno lapwonye meno otere paco, ogwoke.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">To pa Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mar 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23:44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:21">Jab 69:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 22:15">22:15</ref></char>
    </note> Lacen inge man, Yecu onongo ongeyo ni jami ducu dong otum woko; wek ginacoya ocobe kakare, ci owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Orwo neka.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Agulu kongo bwino mawac onongo kicibo kunu. Ci ngat mo ikin gi olutu amor i kongo bwino mawaci ci orwako iwi tal, ci oketo i dog Yecu. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Ka Yecu dong ocwiyo kongo bwino mawaci, ci owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Dong otum.”</char> Ci okulu wiye ci oto.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kicobo laknget Yecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Nino meno obedo ceng me yube pi Cabit, omiyo Lujudaya gukwayo Pilato ni myero kitur tyen dano ma kigurugi, ci kitergi woko, wek komgi pe orii iwi yat i ceng Cabit, pien ceng Cabit meno onongo nino madit me karama me kato. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Acikari gubino, guturu tyen dano mukwongo, ki tyen dano me aryone ma ceng kigurugi kacel ki Yecu. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Ento ka guo ikom Yecu, ci guneno ni dong otyeko to woko, ci pe dong guturu tyene. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Ento ngat acel ikin acikari ocobo lakngete ki tong; ci cutcut remo ki pii oo piny ki i lakngete. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Ngat ma ceng oneno kit ma gin man otime obedo caden. Lok ma en obolo tye ada, en ngeyo ni ebolo lok ada, wek wun bene wuye. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:46">Nia 12:46</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 9:12">Wel 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:20">Jab 34:20</ref></char></note> Pien meno ducu otime wek ginacoya ocobe kakare ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:36">“Cogone mo pe kibituru.”<verse eid="JHN 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:37: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Jek 12:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Niy 1:7</ref></char>
    </note> Dok dul ginacoya mukene owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:37">“Gibipiro wanggi ikom ngat ma kicobo.”<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiyiko kom Yecu ilyel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Lacen ingeye, Yucepu me Arimataya, ma onongo en lapwonye pa Yecu, ento i mung, pi lworo Lujudaya, olego Pilato ni myero eter kom Yecu, ci Pilato oye. Ci obino, otero kome. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:1">Jon 3:1</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 3:2">2</ref></char></note> Nikodemo bene, mayam ocito bot Yecu dyewor, obino kun okelo mo ma kur ma kirubu ki atakarac pi gwoko kome, ma peke mito romo kilo pyere adek. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Co aryo meno gutero kom Yecu, guboyo ki bongi matar, kacel ki mo ma kur, macalo kit me yik pa Lujudaya tye. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Kama kigure iye onongo tye poto, i poto meno onongo tye iye lyel manyen kama yam peya kiyiko iye ngat mo. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Pi ceng me yube pa Lujudaya, dok pien bur lyel meno obedo cok ki kunu, omiyo kiyiko Yecu kunu.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocer</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mar 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Inino mukwongo me cabit, Maliam Lamagdala opuk ilyel odiko con ma piny pud col ci oneno ni kikwanyo got woko ki i dog lyel. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Ci en oringo, ocito bot Cimon Petero, ki bot lapwonye meno ma Yecu maroni, ci otitigi ni, “Kikwanyo Rwot woko ki ilyel, ento pe wangeyo kama kikete iye.” <verse eid="JHN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Ci Petero gin ki lapwonye meno gumako yo me cito ilyel. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Gin aryo ducu guringo kacel, ento lapwonye meno oyomo Petero ki ngwec, ci okwongo o ilyel. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Ka oo kunu ci ongiyo i lyel, ci oneno bongi matar ma onongo kiboye kwedeni gudong kakare; ento pe odonyo iye. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Ci Cimon Petero obino kun lube, ci en odonyo ilyel. Ci onongo bongo matar gudong kakare, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />ki kitambara ma ceng obedo tung kuwiyeni, bene onongo pe tye kacel ki bongi matar, ento odole, tye kene pat. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Lacen lapwonye meno ma okwongo o ilyel bene odonyo iye; oneno ci oye. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Pien onongo pud peya guniang ginacoya, ni myero en ocer ki ikin jo ma oto. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Ci Lupwonye meno gudok paco.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu onyute bot Maliam Lamagdala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Mar 16:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Ento Maliam ocung ki woko ikanget bur lyel kun kok. Ikare ma en pud tye kakoko, ci ogungo piny ka ongiyo ilyel. <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />Ci oneno lumalaika aryo ma rukgi tar, kun gubedo kama kipyelo kom Yecu iye, acel tung wiye, acel tung tyene. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Ci lumalaika gupenye ni, “Dako, ikok pingo?” Ci en dok iye ki gin ni, “Kikwanyo Rwoda woko, pe angeyo kama kikete iye.” <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Ka dong oloko lok man, ci oloke, oneno Yecu kun ocung ingeye, ento pe ongeyo ni en Yecu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yecu openye ni, <char style="wj">“Dako, ikok pingo? Iyenyo anga?”</char> Ci Maliam otamo ni gwok nyo en lapur poto, ci owace ni, “Ladit, ka in aye itere, tita kama ikete iye, wek acit akwanye.” <verse eid="JHN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Ci Yecu olwonge ni, <char style="wj">“Maliam.”</char> Maliam oloke, ci owace ileb Ibru ni, “Raboni!” (Ma te loke ni, “Lapwony.”) <verse eid="JHN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Ci Yecu owace ni, <char style="wj">“Pe i gud koma, pien peya acito bot Won. Ento cit bot utmega, wek ititigi ni, an atye kacito bot Wora ki bot Wonwu, bot Lubangana ki bot Lubangawu.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Ci Maliam Lamagdala ocito, owaco bot lupwonye ni. “Aneno Rwot”; ci otitigi ni Rwot owaco lok magi bote.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu onyute bot lupwonyene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-15">Mar 16:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Otyeno me nino meno, ma en nino mukwongo me cabit, ma onongo dong kicego dogola kama lupwonye gucoke iye pi lworo Lujudaya, Yecu obino, ocung idyergi, ci owaco ki gin ni, <char style="wj">“Kuc obed kwedwu.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Ka dong Yecu owaco lok man, ci onyutu cinge ki lakngete. Lupwonye cwinygi obedo yom ka guneno Rwot. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Ci Yecu dok owaco ki gin ni, <char style="wj">“Kuc obed kwedwu. Kitmacalo Won ceng oora, an bene aorowu.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Ka owaco man, ci oywe ikomgi, ci owaco ki gin ni, <char style="wj">“Wugam Cwiny Maleng.</char> <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:19">Mat 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:18">18:18</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ka wugonyo bal pa ngat mo, ci dong kibigonyo; ka pe wugonyo bal pa ngat mo, ci dong pe kibigonyo.”</char><verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tomaci okwero ye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Tomaci, ngat acel ikin jo apar wiye aryo, ma kilwongo ni Bangi, onongo pe botgi ikare ma Yecu obino. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Ci Lupwonye mukene gutite ni, “Waneno Rwot.” Ento en odok iye ki gin ni, “Ka pe aneno poyo me cumar i cinge, kiketo nyig cinga iwang poyo me cumar, kiketo cinga i lakngete, pe abiye kadi matidi mo.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Ka nino aboro okato, lupwonyene dok gubedo i ot, Tomaci bene onongo tye kwedgi. Onongo gucego dogola, ento Yecu obino, ocung idyergi, ci owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Kuc obed kwedwu.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Lacen owaco bot Tomaci ni, <char style="wj">“Cwal nyig cingi kany, inen cinga; rye cingi iket i lakngeta; pe i bed ki akalakala, ento bed ma i ye.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Tomaci ogamo ni, “In i Rwoda ki Lubangana” <verse eid="JHN 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Yecu openye ni, <char style="wj">“Pien inena omiyo iye? Tye ki gum dano ma pe guneno, ma guye.”</char><verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok ma omiyo kicoyo buk man</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Yecu otiyo lanyut mapol inyim lupwonyene, ma pe kicoyogi i buk man. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Ento magi kicoyo wek wuye ni, Yecu en Kricito ma Lubanga oyero, Wod pa Lubanga, ci ka wuye, wek wubed ki kwo inyinge.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu onen bot lupwonye abiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Lacen ingeye, Yecu dok onyute bot lupwonyene i dog nam Tiberia. En onyute kit man: <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Cimon Petero, Tomaci ma kilwongo ni Bangi, Natanael me Kana me Galilaya, lutino pa Jebedayo ki jo aryo mukene ikin lupwonyene onongo gitye kacel. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:5">Luk 5:5</ref></char></note> Cimon Petero owaco ki gin ni, “Atye kacito kamako rec.” Ci gin gugamo doge ni, “Wan bene wabicito kwedi.” Ci gucito, gudonyo i yeya; ento i dyewor meno pe gumako gin mo.<verse eid="JHN 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Ka piny pud oru aruya, ci Yecu obino ocung iwi tera, ento lupwonyene pe gungeyo ni meno Yecu. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Ci Yecu openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Lurema, wunongo dek mo twal?”</char> Ci gudoke iye ni, “Pe”. <verse eid="JHN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:6">Luk 5:6</ref></char></note> Ci en owacigi ni, <char style="wj">“Wubol obwo tung lacuc me yeya ci wubinongo rec.”</char> Ci gubolo obwo ento tingone ongayogi woko pi pol pa rec. <verse eid="JHN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Ci Lapwonye meno ma Yecu maro owaco ki petero ni, “Meno Rwot!” Ka Cimon Petero owinyo ni meno Rwot, ci odwalo bongone, pien onongo ogonyogi woko pi tic, ci okwore i nam. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Ento lupwonye mukene gubino i yeya, kun giywayo obwo ma opong ki rec, pien onongo pe gibor ki wi tera, mito romo tyen miya acel.<verse eid="JHN 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Ka dong gukati woko iwi tera, ci guneno mac miri kunu, ma kiketo rec iwiye, ki mugati. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Ci Yecu owacigi ni, <char style="wj">“Wukel rec mogo ma pud wumako amakani.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Ci Cimon Petero oito i yeya, oywayo obwo, ci okelo iwi tera, kun opong ki rec madito, miya acel ki pyere abic wiye adek. Kadi bed gipol ento obwo pe oyec. <figure style="fig" alt="So Simon went aboard and hauld the net ashore" file="4402111.TIF" size="col" copy="Anie Volton" ref="21:11">Cimon Petero oywayo obwo okelo iwi tera</figure> <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Ci Yecu owacigi ni, <char style="wj">“Wubin kacam.”</char> Pe tye ngat mo ikin lupwonye ma odiyo cwinye me penye ni, “In anga?” Pien gungeyo ni en Rwot. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Yecu obino, okwanyo mugati, ci opoko ki gin, ki rec bene kitmeno. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Man obedo tyen me adeke ma Yecu onyute kwede bot lupwonyene, madong en ocer ki ikin jo ma oto.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu gin ki Petero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Ka dong gutyeko cam, ci Yecu openyo Cimon Petero ni, <char style="wj">“Cimon wod pa Jon, in imara makato joni ducu?”</char> Ci Petero ogamo ni, “Eyo, Rwot, in ingeyo ni an amari.” Ci ocike ni, <char style="wj">“Kwa lutino romina.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Yecu dok openye tyen me aryo ni, <char style="wj">“Cimon wod pa Jon, in imara?”</char> Petero dok ogamo ni, “Eyo Rwot, in ingeyo ni an amari.” Ci Yecu ocike ni, <char style="wj">“Gwok romina.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Yecu dok openye tyen me adeke ni, <char style="wj">“Cimon wod pa Jon, in imara?”</char> Ci cwiny Petero obale pien Yecu openye tyen me adeke ni, “Imara?” Ci Petero owace ni, “Rwot, in ingeyo jami ducu; in ingeyo ni an amari.” Ci Yecu ocike ni, <char style="wj">“Kwa romina. </char> <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" /><char style="wj">Adada awaci ni, ka in pud itye awobi, ci itweyo bongoni keni, iwoto icito kama i mito; ento ka dong itii, ci ibimito kony ki bot ngat mukene wek otweni bongoni, dok bene biteri kama pe i mito.” </char> <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Yecu owaco man pi nyutu kit to ma Petero bito kwede ci biketo deyo ikom Lubanga. Ka Yecu oloko lok man, ci owace ni, <char style="wj">“Luba.”</char><verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu gin ki Lapwonye me amara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 13:25">Jon 13:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ka Petero oloke, ci oneno lapwonye meno ma Yecu maro kun lubugi, en aye ngat ma ceng obedo cok adada ki Yecu i dog cam me otyeno, ma owaco ni, “Rwot, anga ma bidobi?” <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Ka Petero onene, ci openyo Yecu ni, “Rwot, danoni kono?” <verse eid="JHN 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Ci Yecu owace ni, <char style="wj">“Ka amito ni en orii nio ka abidwogo, ci ilaro ango iye kono? In luba.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Lok man oywek ikin utmego, ni lapwonye man pe bito; ento Yecu onongo pe owaco ni en pe bito, ento ni, <char style="wj">“Ka amito ni en orii nio ka abidwogo, ci ilaro ango iye kono?”</char><verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Man aye lapwonye ma obedo caden ikom lok magi, dok ocoyogi; wan bene wangeyo ni lok ma en obolo obedo ada.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok me agiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Tye bene gin mukene mapol ma Yecu otiyo. Ka onongo kicoyogi ki acel acel, atamo ni kono lobo kulu pe otwero romo buk ma kicoyo.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>